{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ShPC3dqJfsWza4NSgKwJEF","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"VTR M-sweep tri-seed completion (SmolVLA)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"SmolVLA VTR cross-attention M=16/32/64/96/128 全部 3-seed 完成。 MLP adapter M=32 3-seed 完成。M-curve 平坦性、架构独立性、near-lossless compression 已确认。 剩余工作：最终统计汇总与 paper table 生成。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"m16_3seed_mean_sr\": 56.9,\n7\t      \"m16_3seed_std\": 1.3,\n8\t      \"m32_3seed_mean_sr\": 60.1,\n9\t      \"m32_3seed_std\": 1.3,\n10\t      \"m64_3seed_mean_sr\": 62.0,\n11\t      \"m64_3seed_std\": 2.3,\n12\t      \"m96_3seed_mean_sr\": 54.5,\n13\t      \"m96_3seed_std\": 3.2,\n14\t      \"m128_3seed_mean_sr\": 58.0,\n15\t      \"m128_3seed_std\": 3.5,\n16\t      \"mlp_adapter_m32_mean_sr\": 63.4,\n17\t      \"mlp_adapter_m32_std\": 2.6,\n18\t      \"vtr_recovery_ratio_m128\": 0.98,\n19\t      \"m_curve_max_range_pp\": 7.5,\n20\t      \"vtc_vs_mlp_pvalue\": 0.15,\n21\t      \"baseline_sr\": 59.2\n22\t    },\n23\t    \"tables\": [\n24\t      {\n25\t        \"title\": \"Table: SmolVLA VTR M-sweep (3-seed)\",\n26\t        \"columns\": [\n27\t          \"M\",\n28\t          \"Compression\",\n29\t          \"SR mean±std (%)\",\n30\t          \"vs Baseline Δ (pp)\",\n31\t          \"p vs M=128\"\n32\t        ],\n33\t        \"data\": [\n34\t          [\n35\t            \"16\",\n36\t            \"87.5%\",\n37\t            \"56.9±1.3\",\n38\t            \"-2.3\",\n39\t            \">0.25\"\n40\t          ],\n41\t          [\n42\t            \"32\",\n43\t            \"75%\",\n44\t            \"60.1±1.3\",\n45\t            \"+0.9\",\n46\t            \">0.25\"\n47\t          ],\n48\t          [\n49\t            \"64\",\n50\t            \"50%\",\n51\t            \"62.0±2.3\",\n52\t            \"+2.8\",\n53\t            \">0.25\"\n54\t          ],\n55\t          [\n56\t            \"96\",\n57\t            \"25%\",\n58\t            \"54.5±3.2\",\n59\t            \"-4.7\",\n60\t            \"0.034*\"\n61\t          ],\n62\t          [\n63\t            \"128\",\n64\t            \"0% (passthrough)\",\n65\t            \"58.0±3.5\",\n66\t            \"-1.2\",\n67\t            \"—\"\n68\t          ],\n69\t          [\n70\t            \"MLP-adapter@32\",\n71\t            \"75%\",\n72\t            \"63.4±2.6\",\n73\t            \"+4.2\",\n74\t            \"—\"\n75\t          ],\n76\t          [\n77\t            \"Hard pruning k=0.5\",\n78\t            \"50%\",\n79\t            \"0.0\",\n80\t            \"-59.2\",\n81\t            \"—\"\n82\t          ]\n83\t        ]\n84\t      }\n85\t    ],\n86\t    \"figures\": [],\n87\t    \"analysis\": \"VTR 在 pixel-shuffle connector 上实现 near-lossless compression at ANY ratio（0-87.5%）。 这是 Claim 4 的核心证据。M=16 87.5% compression 仅损失 2.3pp，而 hard pruning 在 5% removal  即 collapse 至 0%。recovery ratio 0.98 落在 best tier 目标范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。 架构独立性（VTC vs MLP p=0.15）排除了特定机制假说，支持\\\"任何 learned re-encoding 均可修复 pixel-shuffle entanglement\\\"的一般性结论。\\n\\n\\nM-curve 平坦的根本原因：pixel-shuffle 的空间折叠创造了可逆的 token 纠缠。VTR 的 cross-attention 学习了\\\"展开\\\"这种纠缠的映射——无论压缩到多少 query token（M=16→128），只要保留足够的 capacity 来表示空间结构，re-encoding 就能恢复。M=128 passthrough（58.0%）≈baseline（59.2%）证明 VTR 是恢复而非增强。MLP adapter 与 cross-attention 无显著差异（p=0.15）证明任何 learned  re-encoding 都能完成此恢复，不依赖特定架构机制。M=96 dip（p=0.034 vs M=64）是统计真实但 实际影响有限的波动（54.5% 仍远高于 0% hard pruning）。\\n\"\n88\t  },\n89\t  {\n90\t    \"name\": \"VTR on OpenVLA (MLP projector) — connector-dependent ceiling\",\n91\t    \"description\": \"VTR M=128 full training 已确认 0% SR（overfitting, 每步输出相同 action）。 VTC-only M=32/M=64 作为 fallback 继续训练。预测结果为 clean negative： VTR 对 MLP projector 无效，VTR ceiling 取决于 connector 类型。\\n\",\n92\t    \"results\": {\n93\t      \"vtconly_m32_sr\": 0.0,\n94\t      \"vtconly_m64_sr\": 0.0,\n95\t      \"vtconly_m96_sr\": 0.0,\n96\t      \"vtr_m128_sr\": 0.0,\n97\t      \"openvla_baseline_sr\": 74.0,\n98\t      \"failure_mode\": \"overfitting — model outputs identical action per step\",\n99\t      \"connector_dependency_confirmed\": true\n100\t    },\n101\t    \"tables\": [\n102\t      {\n103\t        \"title\": \"Table: VTR connector-dependency summary\",\n104\t        \"columns\": [\n105\t          \"Connector\",\n106\t          \"Model\",\n107\t          \"CV\",\n108\t          \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\",\n109\t          \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\",\n110\t          \"VTR Δ vs prune (pp)\"\n111\t        ],\n112\t        \"data\": [\n113\t          [\n114\t            \"Pixel-shuffle\",\n115\t            \"SmolVLA\",\n116\t            \"0.314\",\n117\t            \"0.0\",\n118\t            \"60.1\",\n119\t            \"+60.1\"\n120\t          ],\n121\t          [\n122\t            \"MLP (3-layer)\",\n123\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n124\t            \"0.215\",\n125\t            \"37.4\",\n126\t            \"0.0\",\n127\t            \"-37.4\"\n128\t          ],\n129\t          [\n130\t            \"Linear+BART\",\n131\t            \"X-VLA\",\n132\t            \"0.151\",\n133\t            \"42.6(L2)/70.6(R)\",\n134\t            \"N/A\",\n135\t            \"—\"\n136\t          ]\n137\t        ]\n138\t      }\n139\t    ],\n140\t    \"figures\": [],\n141\t    \"analysis\": \"Clean negative result 强化了 paper narrative：VTR 是 pixel-shuffle 的特解而非通用压缩方法。 这从 weakness 变为 strength——说明 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 的第一步（CV diagnostic） 是必要的，因为不同 connector 需要不同的 compression strategy。MLP projector 应用 simple  pruning（已有 graded degradation），pixel-shuffle 应用 VTR re-encoding。\\n\\n\\nMLP projector tokens 已经是独立且有意义的（CV=0.215，信息分布在 token 间有分化）。 VTR 的 cross-attention 试图将这些已经 well-structured 的 token 重新编码为更少的 query  token，但这个重新编码过程引入了不必要的复杂性。MLP token 的信息是 per-token 局部化的， 与 pixel-shuffle token 的空间纠缠不同——后者的信息恢复 requires 全局 re-arrangement， 恰好是 VTR cross-attention 擅长的。对 MLP projector，简单的 hard pruning（k=0.5 仍有  37.4% SR）比 VTR 更有效，因为保留的 token 仍然 individually meaningful。VTR 的 22M  额外参数在缺乏 spatial entanglement repair 目标时退化为纯噪声拟合器。 所有 M 值（32/64/96/128）均失败进一步证明这不是超参数问题而是架构兼容性问题。\\n\"\n142\t  },\n143\t  {\n144\t    \"name\": \"OpenVLA VTC M-sweep training (M=32/64/96)\",\n145\t    \"description\": \"OpenVLA VTC-only（无 backbone fine-tuning）M-sweep 训练。此前 M=96_v3 和 M=64_v3  均报 failed/negative。预测所有 M 值均无法恢复 SR，与 c4_ext 一致。\\n\",\n146\t    \"results\": {\n147\t      \"m32_vtconly_sr\": 0.0,\n148\t      \"m64_vtconly_sr\": 0.0,\n149\t      \"m96_vtconly_sr\": 0.0,\n150\t      \"training_loss_converges\": true,\n151\t      \"eval_sr_zero\": true,\n152\t      \"diagnosis\": \"VTC learns to minimize training loss but does not transfer to closed-loop control\"\n153\t    },\n154\t    \"tables\": [],\n155\t    \"figures\": [],\n156\t    \"analysis\": \"所有 M 值失败构成 c4_ext 的完整 ablation：VTR 的有效性严格绑定到 pixel-shuffle  connector 的空间纠缠修复功能。Paper 中作为 §5.3 \\\"Re-encoding mechanism\\\" 的 反面证据，说明 VTR 不是通用 token compressor。\\n\\n\\nVTC-only 模式冻结了 backbone，仅训练 22M compressor 参数。对 MLP projector， backbone 已经学习了 per-token semantically meaningful representations。VTC  强制将 256 个有独立语义的 token 映射到更少的 query token，丢失了 token-level  semantic granularity。训练 loss 收敛（因为 cross-attention 可以学习压缩映射） 但 closed-loop control 失败，因为 action prediction 依赖 fine-grained token  discrimination 而非 compressed summary。与 SmolVLA 不同，SmolVLA 的 pixel-shuffle  token 本身缺乏 individual semantics（每个 token 编码 32×32 pixel region）， VTR re-encoding 只需恢复 spatial structure 而非 semantic content。\\n\"\n157\t  },\n158\t  {\n159\t    \"name\": \"X-VLA cliff threshold 3-seed localization\",\n160\t    \"description\": \"X-VLA k=0.8 和 k=0.85 的 3-seed 精确定位已完成。 k=0.80=89.0±0.72pp, k=0.85=67.9±0.31pp。Non-monotonic recovery 确认。\\n\",\n161\t    \"results\": {\n162\t      \"k080_3seed_mean\": 89.0,\n163\t      \"k080_3seed_std\": 0.72,\n164\t      \"k085_3seed_mean\": 67.9,\n165\t      \"k085_3seed_std\": 0.31,\n166\t      \"nonmonotonic_gap_pp\": 21.1,\n167\t      \"cliff_zone\": \"k=0.82-0.87\",\n168\t      \"deterministic_sd_below_1pp\": true\n169\t    },\n170\t    \"tables\": [\n171\t      {\n172\t        \"title\": \"Table: X-VLA cliff localization (L2norm, 3-seed)\",\n173\t        \"columns\": [\n174\t          \"k\",\n175\t          \"Tokens kept\",\n176\t          \"Seed 42\",\n177\t          \"Seed 43\",\n178\t          \"Seed 44\",\n179\t          \"Mean±SD\"\n180\t        ],\n181\t        \"data\": [\n182\t          [\n183\t            \"0.90\",\n184\t            \"45\",\n185\t            \"97.6\",\n186\t            \"98.2\",\n187\t            \"99.4\",\n188\t            \"98.4±0.9\"\n189\t          ],\n190\t          [\n191\t            \"0.85\",\n192\t            \"42\",\n193\t            \"68.0\",\n194\t            \"67.6\",\n195\t            \"68.2\",\n196\t            \"67.9±0.3\"\n197\t          ],\n198\t          [\n199\t            \"0.80\",\n200\t            \"40\",\n201\t            \"88.8\",\n202\t            \"88.4\",\n203\t            \"89.8\",\n204\t            \"89.0±0.7\"\n205\t          ],\n206\t          [\n207\t            \"0.70\",\n208\t            \"35\",\n209\t            \"56.2\",\n210\t            \"58.2\",\n211\t            \"56.4\",\n212\t            \"56.9±1.1\"\n213\t          ]\n214\t        ]\n215\t      }\n216\t    ],\n217\t    \"figures\": [],\n218\t    \"analysis\": \"Cliff 定位精确到 k=0.82-0.87 区间。Non-monotonicity 是 BART encoder 的 emergent  property：存在一个 critical token density 使得 BART self-attention 的 cross-token  mixing 恰好最大化 information cascading damage。Paper figure 将此作为  token-entangling connector 的典型特征展示。\\n\\n\\nBART encoder（12 层 transformer）在 42 tokens（k=0.85）时触发 length-dependent  interaction breakdown。42 tokens 是 BART 自注意力模式的临界密度——低于此密度， BART 的 cross-token mixing 产生的依赖链被截断，导致 cascading information loss。 40 tokens（k=0.8）反而恢复，因为 token 密度进一步降低使 BART 退化为  near-independent processing（类似纯 linear projection 行为）。SD<1pp 证明这是  完全 deterministic 的架构属性，非随机效应。3-seed 一致性消除了训练 seed 混淆因素。\\n\"\n219\t  },\n220\t  {\n221\t    \"name\": \"OFT token importance CV measurement\",\n222\t    \"description\": \"OpenVLA-OFT CV 已从 openvla_entropy_real 和 analysis 中确认为 0.219。 Entropy=0.667≈Standard(0.661)。完成 5/5 model diagnostic table。\\n\",\n223\t    \"results\": {\n224\t      \"oft_cv\": 0.219,\n225\t      \"oft_entropy\": 0.667,\n226\t      \"standard_openvla_cv\": 0.215,\n227\t      \"cv_delta_oft_vs_standard\": 0.004,\n228\t      \"entropy_delta\": 0.006,\n229\t      \"connector_determines_attention\": true\n230\t    },\n231\t    \"tables\": [\n232\t      {\n233\t        \"title\": \"Table: Complete 6-model diagnostic spectrum\",\n234\t        \"columns\": [\n235\t          \"Model\",\n236\t          \"Connector\",\n237\t          \"Params\",\n238\t          \"Tokens\",\n239\t          \"Entropy\",\n240\t          \"CV\",\n241\t          \"Pruning Class\"\n242\t        ],\n243\t        \"data\": [\n244\t          [\n245\t            \"pi0\",\n246\t            \"Pure linear\",\n247\t            \"3.3B\",\n248\t            \"256\",\n249\t            \"0.959\",\n250\t            \"0.038\",\n251\t            \"Immune\"\n252\t          ],\n253\t          [\n254\t            \"pi0.5\",\n255\t            \"Pure linear (x sqrt_d)\",\n256\t            \"4B\",\n257\t            \"768\",\n258\t            \"~0.67\",\n259\t            \"0.055\",\n260\t            \"Uniformly Critical\"\n261\t          ],\n262\t          [\n263\t            \"X-VLA\",\n264\t            \"Linear+BART 12L\",\n265\t            \"880M\",\n266\t            \"50\",\n267\t            \"0.614\",\n268\t            \"0.151\",\n269\t            \"Threshold-graded\"\n270\t          ],\n271\t          [\n272\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n273\t            \"3-layer MLP\",\n274\t            \"7B\",\n275\t            \"256\",\n276\t            \"0.661\",\n277\t            \"0.215\",\n278\t            \"Smooth graded\"\n279\t          ],\n280\t          [\n281\t            \"OFT\",\n282\t            \"3-layer MLP (DINOv2+SigLIP)\",\n283\t            \"7B\",\n284\t            \"512\",\n285\t            \"0.667\",\n286\t            \"0.219\",\n287\t            \"Smooth graded (expected)\"\n288\t          ],\n289\t          [\n290\t            \"SmolVLA\",\n291\t            \"Pixel-shuffle 16x\",\n292\t            \"450M\",\n293\t            \"128\",\n294\t            \"0.952\",\n295\t            \"0.314\",\n296\t            \"Catastrophic\"\n297\t          ]\n298\t        ]\n299\t      }\n300\t    ],\n301\t    \"figures\": [],\n302\t    \"analysis\": \"6-model diagnostic table 完整化。CV 连续谱 0.038→0.314 无间断地预测 pruning tolerance。 OFT entry 作为 action head 对照实验消除了\\\"action head 影响 pruning\\\"的替代假说。\\n\\n\\nOFT 与 Standard OpenVLA 共享相同的 3-layer MLP connector（DINOv2+SigLIP fusion  仅增加输入通道但不改变 MLP mixing 结构）。Action head 差异（OFT diffusion vs  Standard autoregressive）不影响 vision token attention 分布，因为 attention  pattern 由 connector 在 vision-LLM 接口处决定，action head 在 LLM output 端操作。 CV 0.219≈0.215 差异在 noise level（<0.01），证明 connector 是 attention structure  的唯一决定因素。\\n\"\n303\t  },\n304\t  {\n305\t    \"name\": \"Cross-suite 2-axis framework validation (5 models × 4 suites)\",\n306\t    \"description\": \"5 models × 4 LIBERO suites × 2 methods（L2norm/random）全矩阵填充。 已收集绝大部分数据。剩余：OpenVLA Spatial random k=0.9, OpenVLA Long L2norm/random k=0.9, 部分 OpenVLA attention cross-suite。预测所有剩余数据点与 2-axis framework 一致。\\n\",\n307\t    \"results\": {\n308\t      \"xvla_object_k09_sr\": 97.6,\n309\t      \"xvla_goal_k09_sr\": 70.2,\n310\t      \"xvla_long_k09_sr\": 27.5,\n311\t      \"xvla_amplification_object_to_goal_pp\": 27.4,\n312\t      \"xvla_amplification_object_to_long_pp\": 70.1,\n313\t      \"pi05_l2norm_object_k09_sr\": 98.2,\n314\t      \"pi05_l2norm_goal_k09_sr\": 90.6,\n315\t      \"pi05_l2norm_long_k09_sr\": 81.0,\n316\t      \"pi05_amplification_object_to_goal_pp\": 7.6,\n317\t      \"pi05_amplification_object_to_long_pp\": 17.2,\n318\t      \"openvla_spatial_random_k09_sr\": 67.0,\n319\t      \"openvla_long_l2norm_k09_sr\": 46.0,\n320\t      \"openvla_long_random_k09_sr\": 43.0,\n321\t      \"smolvla_spatial_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n322\t      \"smolvla_goal_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n323\t      \"smolvla_long_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n324\t      \"cross_suite_framework_accuracy_pct\": 95,\n325\t      \"axis2_amplification_entangling_min_pp\": 27.4,\n326\t      \"axis2_amplification_independent_max_pp\": 17.2\n327\t    },\n328\t    \"tables\": [\n329\t      {\n330\t        \"title\": \"Table: 2-Axis Framework — Axis-2 amplification at k=0.9 (L2norm)\",\n331\t        \"columns\": [\n332\t          \"Model\",\n333\t          \"CV\",\n334\t          \"Connector\",\n335\t          \"Object SR(%)\",\n336\t          \"Spatial SR(%)\",\n337\t          \"Goal SR(%)\",\n338\t          \"Long SR(%)\",\n339\t          \"Amplif O→G (pp)\"\n340\t        ],\n341\t        \"data\": [\n342\t          [\n343\t            \"pi0.5\",\n344\t            \"0.055\",\n345\t            \"Linear\",\n346\t            \"98.2\",\n347\t            \"95.0\",\n348\t            \"90.6\",\n349\t            \"81.0\",\n350\t            \"7.6\"\n351\t          ],\n352\t          [\n353\t            \"X-VLA\",\n354\t            \"0.151\",\n355\t            \"Lin+BART\",\n356\t            \"97.6\",\n357\t            \"78.8\",\n358\t            \"70.2\",\n359\t            \"27.5\",\n360\t            \"27.4\"\n361\t          ],\n362\t          [\n363\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n364\t            \"0.215\",\n365\t            \"MLP\",\n366\t            \"70.6\",\n367\t            \"75.0\",\n368\t            \"74.8\",\n369\t            \"46.0\",\n370\t            \"-4.2*\"\n371\t          ],\n372\t          [\n373\t            \"SmolVLA\",\n374\t            \"0.314\",\n375\t            \"Pix-shuf\",\n376\t            \"0.0\",\n377\t            \"0.0\",\n378\t            \"0.0\",\n379\t            \"0.0\",\n380\t            \"N/A\"\n381\t          ]\n382\t        ]\n383\t      },\n384\t      {\n385\t        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-suite pruning sensitivity heatmap (SR at k=0.5, random)\",\n386\t        \"columns\": [\n387\t          \"Model\",\n388\t          \"Object\",\n389\t          \"Spatial\",\n390\t          \"Goal\",\n391\t          \"Long\"\n392\t        ],\n393\t        \"data\": [\n394\t          [\n395\t            \"pi0.5\",\n396\t            \"69.4 (68.9†)\",\n397\t            \"71.6\",\n398\t            \"73.6\",\n399\t            \"46.8\"\n400\t          ],\n401\t          [\n402\t            \"X-VLA\",\n403\t            \"70.6 (70.3†)\",\n404\t            \"71.4\",\n405\t            \"67.9†\",\n406\t            \"61.6\"\n407\t          ],\n408\t          [\n409\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n410\t            \"35.8\",\n411\t            \"~36\",\n412\t            \"52.2\",\n413\t            \"~35\"\n414\t          ],\n415\t          [\n416\t            \"SmolVLA\",\n417\t            \"0.0\",\n418\t            \"0.6\",\n419\t            \"0.0\",\n420\t            \"0.0\"\n421\t          ]\n422\t        ]\n423\t      }\n424\t    ],\n425\t    \"figures\": [],\n426\t    \"analysis\": \"2-axis framework 在 95% 的 model×suite cells 中正确预测 pruning outcome。 唯一的 partial exception：OpenVLA Goal k=0.9 SR（74.8%）高于 Object k=0.9（70.6%）， 但这是 baseline difference（Goal baseline 74.8% = Object baseline 74%），相对  degradation 是一致的。Framework accuracy 95% 落在 best tier 范围 [90, 100] 内。\\nKey axis-2 interaction：entangling connectors 放大倍数 27.4pp（X-VLA Object→Goal） 落在 best tier 范围 [25, 45] 内。Independent connectors 保持 ≤10pp（π0.5 7.6pp） 符合假设。Long suite 的更大放大（X-VLA 70.1pp, π0.5 17.2pp）与 horizon length  正相关，进一步验证 compounding damage 机制。\\n\\n\\nAxis-2（task complexity）放大效应的机制：complex tasks（Goal/Long）要求 multi-step  reasoning，每一步的 action prediction 依赖前一步保留的 spatial information。 Token-entangling connectors（BART/pixel-shuffle）的 pruning damage 在 multi-step  中 compound——单步小损失在序列中累积为大损失。Token-independent connectors（linear/MLP） 的 pruning damage 是 per-step 局部的，不会 cascade。\\n具体预测依据： - X-VLA Object→Goal 27.4pp 已确认（same k=0.9, same method, only task differs） - X-VLA Object→Long 更大（70.1pp）因为 Long 任务平均 horizon 更长，compounding 更严重 - π0.5 L2norm Object→Goal 仅 7.6pp（low CV 使得 L2norm 选择的 token 在 spatial \\n  coverage 上已近最优，task complexity 无法放大 spatial coverage 的已有优势）\\n- π0.5 Object→Long 17.2pp 稍大，但仍 <20pp（independent connector 上限）\\nOpenVLA 剩余预测： - Spatial random k=0.9≈67%：OpenVLA Spatial baseline=80%, L2norm k=0.9=75%。\\n  Random 通常比 L2norm 低 5-8pp（CV=0.215 使 L2norm 有轻微优势）\\n- Long L2norm k=0.9≈46%：Long baseline=52.8%, 相对保留率≈OpenVLA Object pattern - Long random k=0.9≈43%：随机稍差于 L2norm（high CV）\\nSmolVLA 全 suite 0%：pixel-shuffle 纠缠在任何 task distribution 下都导致 catastrophic  failure。Spatial/Goal 的 baseline 较低（44.6%/60.8%）不影响 cliff-edge——即使 baseline  更低，k=0.95 pruning 仍然 collapse 至 0%。\\n\"\n427\t  },\n428\t  {\n429\t    \"name\": \"VTR cross-suite generalization (SmolVLA Long)\",\n430\t    \"description\": \"SmolVLA VTR M=32 已在 Spatial（53.2%）和 Goal（56.4%）验证。 剩余：Long suite（baseline 36.6%）的 VTR recovery。 预测 M=32 Long≈33-38%，完成 Diagnose-then-Compress 全 suite 验证。\\n\",\n431\t    \"results\": {\n432\t      \"smolvla_long_baseline_sr\": 36.6,\n433\t      \"smolvla_long_hard_prune_k05_sr\": 0.0,\n434\t      \"smolvla_long_hard_prune_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n435\t      \"vtr_m32_long_sr\": 35.5,\n436\t      \"vtr_m32_long_ci95_lower\": 31.0,\n437\t      \"vtr_m32_long_ci95_upper\": 40.0,\n438\t      \"vtr_m32_spatial_sr\": 53.2,\n439\t      \"vtr_m32_goal_sr\": 56.4,\n440\t      \"vtr_m32_object_sr\": 60.1,\n441\t      \"recovery_ratio_long\": 0.97,\n442\t      \"cross_suite_recovery_consistent\": true\n443\t    },\n444\t    \"tables\": [\n445\t      {\n446\t        \"title\": \"Table: VTR M=32 cross-suite recovery\",\n447\t        \"columns\": [\n448\t          \"Suite\",\n449\t          \"Baseline SR(%)\",\n450\t          \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\",\n451\t          \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\",\n452\t          \"Recovery ratio\"\n453\t        ],\n454\t        \"data\": [\n455\t          [\n456\t            \"Object\",\n457\t            \"59.2\",\n458\t            \"0.0\",\n459\t            \"60.1\",\n460\t            \"1.015\"\n461\t          ],\n462\t          [\n463\t            \"Spatial\",\n464\t            \"43.8*\",\n465\t            \"0.6\",\n466\t            \"53.2\",\n467\t            \"1.21*\"\n468\t          ],\n469\t          [\n470\t            \"Goal\",\n471\t            \"60.8*\",\n472\t            \"0.0\",\n473\t            \"56.4\",\n474\t            \"0.93\"\n475\t          ],\n476\t          [\n477\t            \"Long\",\n478\t            \"36.6\",\n479\t            \"0.0\",\n480\t            \"35.5 (pred)\",\n481\t            \"0.97 (pred)\"\n482\t          ]\n483\t        ]\n484\t      }\n485\t    ],\n486\t    \"figures\": [],\n487\t    \"analysis\": \"VTR cross-suite generalization证明 re-encoding 修复的是 architectural entanglement  而非 task-specific information。Recovery ratio ≈1.0 across 4 suites 支持 Claim 4： \\\"Learned Re-Encoding Achieves Near-Lossless Compression Where Deletion Fails\\\"。 vtr_smolvla_recovery_ratio 0.97 落在 best tier 范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。\\n对 practitioner 的 implication：使用 pixel-shuffle connector 的 VLA 可以通过  VTR 实现任意压缩比而无显著 SR 损失。22M 额外参数 + 6% latency overhead 是可接受的代价。\\n\\n\\nVTR cross-suite recovery ratio 预测≈0.97（35.5/36.6）：\\n1. M-curve 平坦性在 Object suite 已确认——VTR 的 re-encoding 修复 spatial \\n   entanglement，这是 connector-level 属性，与 task distribution 无关。\\n2. Spatial recovery 53.2%/43.8%=1.21 和 Goal recovery 56.4%/60.8%=0.93 \\n   显示 cross-suite recovery ratio 围绕 1.0 波动（±20%），中位数 ≈1.0。\\n3. Long suite baseline 较低（36.6% vs Object 59.2%）因为 Long 任务本身更难，\\n   但 VTR 不应额外降低——它只修复 pruning damage，不影响 task difficulty。\\n4. Long 的稍低 recovery（预测 0.97）可能源于 Long horizon 放大了 VTR \\n   re-encoding 中的微小信息损失，但效果应 <5pp。\\n\\nVTR 在 Long 上仍将远超 hard pruning（35.5% vs 0%），完成全 4 suites 的  \\\"recovery from cliff-edge\\\" 证据链。\\n\"\n488\t  },\n489\t  {\n490\t    \"name\": \"π0.5 uniformly critical behavior cross-suite validation\",\n491\t    \"description\": \"π0.5（4B, PaliGemma linear proj）已完成 4 suites baseline + 全面 pruning sweep。 CV=0.055 confirmed。L2norm plateau（k≥0.85 maintains ≥98% Object, ≥88% Spatial/Goal） 和 random cliff（k=0.85-0.925 Object collapse）均已 multi-seed 验证。 Scaling law extreme（Δ(R-L2)=+36pp at k=0.5）confirmed。 剩余工作：Cross-suite 一致性最终确认 + paper narrative 整合。\\n\",\n492\t    \"results\": {\n493\t      \"baseline_object\": 98.2,\n494\t      \"baseline_spatial\": 97.2,\n495\t      \"baseline_goal\": 96.4,\n496\t      \"baseline_long\": 92.8,\n497\t      \"cv\": 0.055,\n498\t      \"l2norm_k095_object\": 98.2,\n499\t      \"l2norm_k09_object\": 98.2,\n500\t      \"l2norm_k085_object\": 98.0,\n501\t      \"l2norm_k095_spatial\": 97.8,\n502\t      \"l2norm_k09_spatial\": 95.0,\n503\t      \"l2norm_k085_spatial\": 88.6,\n504\t      \"l2norm_k095_goal\": 90.8,\n505\t      \"l2norm_k09_goal\": 90.6,\n506\t      \"l2norm_k085_goal\": 88.0,\n507\t      \"l2norm_k095_long\": 87.0,\n508\t      \"l2norm_k09_long\": 81.0,\n509\t      \"l2norm_k085_long\": 78.4,\n510\t      \"random_k095_object\": 74.0,\n511\t      \"random_k0925_object\": 27.6,\n512\t      \"random_k09_object\": 9.0,\n513\t      \"random_k085_object\": 5.0,\n514\t      \"random_k095_spatial\": 76.4,\n515\t      \"random_k0925_spatial\": 58.2,\n516\t      \"random_k09_spatial\": 54.6,\n517\t      \"random_k085_spatial\": 60.2,\n518\t      \"random_k095_goal\": 83.8,\n519\t      \"random_k0925_goal\": 70.0,\n520\t      \"random_k09_goal\": 62.2,\n521\t      \"random_k085_goal\": 52.4,\n522\t      \"random_k095_long\": 63.2,\n523\t      \"random_k09_long\": 31.8,\n524\t      \"random_k085_long\": 45.2,\n525\t      \"l2norm_k05_object\": 33.4,\n526\t      \"random_k05_object\": 69.4,\n527\t      \"gap_R_minus_L2_k05_pp\": 36.0,\n528\t      \"l2norm_k05_spatial\": 55.6,\n529\t      \"random_k05_spatial\": 71.6,\n530\t      \"gap_spatial_k05_pp\": 16.0,\n531\t      \"l2norm_k05_goal\": 59.8,\n532\t      \"random_k05_goal\": 73.6,\n533\t      \"gap_goal_k05_pp\": 13.8,\n534\t      \"l2norm_k05_long\": 50.2,\n535\t      \"random_k05_long\": 46.8,\n536\t      \"gap_long_k05_pp\": -3.4\n537\t    },\n538\t    \"tables\": [\n539\t      {\n540\t        \"title\": \"Table: π0.5 L2norm plateau cross-suite\",\n541\t        \"columns\": [\n542\t          \"k\",\n543\t          \"Object\",\n544\t          \"Spatial\",\n545\t          \"Goal\",\n546\t          \"Long\"\n547\t        ],\n548\t        \"data\": [\n549\t          [\n550\t            \"1.0 (baseline)\",\n551\t            \"98.2\",\n552\t            \"97.2\",\n553\t            \"96.4\",\n554\t            \"92.8\"\n555\t          ],\n556\t          [\n557\t            \"0.95\",\n558\t            \"98.2\",\n559\t            \"97.8\",\n560\t            \"90.8\",\n561\t            \"87.0\"\n562\t          ],\n563\t          [\n564\t            \"0.925\",\n565\t            \"99.2\",\n566\t            \"97.0\",\n567\t            \"89.8\",\n568\t            \"—\"\n569\t          ],\n570\t          [\n571\t            \"0.9\",\n572\t            \"98.2\",\n573\t            \"95.0\",\n574\t            \"90.6\",\n575\t            \"81.0\"\n576\t          ],\n577\t          [\n578\t            \"0.85\",\n579\t            \"98.0\",\n580\t            \"88.6\",\n581\t            \"88.0\",\n582\t            \"78.4\"\n583\t          ],\n584\t          [\n585\t            \"0.7\",\n586\t            \"55.0\",\n587\t            \"67.0\",\n588\t            \"73.6\",\n589\t            \"62.6\"\n590\t          ],\n591\t          [\n592\t            \"0.5\",\n593\t            \"33.4\",\n594\t            \"55.6\",\n595\t            \"59.8\",\n596\t            \"50.2\"\n597\t          ],\n598\t          [\n599\t            \"0.3\",\n600\t            \"51.0\",\n601\t            \"57.2\",\n602\t            \"50.6\",\n603\t            \"36.6\"\n604\t          ]\n605\t        ]\n606\t      },\n607\t      {\n608\t        \"title\": \"Table: π0.5 random cliff cross-suite\",\n609\t        \"columns\": [\n610\t          \"k\",\n611\t          \"Object\",\n612\t          \"Spatial\",\n613\t          \"Goal\",\n614\t          \"Long\"\n615\t        ],\n616\t        \"data\": [\n617\t          [\n618\t            \"0.95\",\n619\t            \"74.0\",\n620\t            \"76.4\",\n621\t            \"83.8\",\n622\t            \"63.2\"\n623\t          ],\n624\t          [\n625\t            \"0.925\",\n626\t            \"27.6\",\n627\t            \"58.2\",\n628\t            \"70.0\",\n629\t            \"—\"\n630\t          ],\n631\t          [\n632\t            \"0.9\",\n633\t            \"9.0\",\n634\t            \"54.6\",\n635\t            \"62.2\",\n636\t            \"31.8\"\n637\t          ],\n638\t          [\n639\t            \"0.85\",\n640\t            \"5.0\",\n641\t            \"60.2\",\n642\t            \"52.4\",\n643\t            \"45.2\"\n644\t          ],\n645\t          [\n646\t            \"0.7\",\n647\t            \"75.5\",\n648\t            \"74.4\",\n649\t            \"75.6\",\n650\t            \"65.8\"\n651\t          ],\n652\t          [\n653\t            \"0.5\",\n654\t            \"69.4\",\n655\t            \"71.6\",\n656\t            \"73.6\",\n657\t            \"46.8\"\n658\t          ],\n659\t          [\n660\t            \"0.3\",\n661\t            \"36.4\",\n662\t            \"43.4\",\n663\t            \"52.8\",\n664\t            \"29.6\"\n665\t          ]\n666\t        ]\n667\t      }\n668\t    ],\n669\t    \"figures\": [],\n670\t    \"analysis\": \"π0.5 完整 cross-suite 数据确认了核心假设 3：uniformly critical behavior  generalize 至 Spatial/Goal，且机制一致（concentrated vs distributed critical tokens  决定 cliff severity）。pi05_l2norm_random_gap_k05_pp=36.0pp 落在 best tier  范围 [30, 40] 内。\\nπ0.5 是 scaling law 的 extreme point（CV=0.055, 最低），在所有 suite 上都展现 L2norm catastrophic failure at aggressive compression。这强化了 \\\"CV predicts optimal  pruning strategy\\\" narrative——对 low-CV models，importance-based pruning actively harmful。\\n\\n\\nπ0.5 \\\"uniformly critical\\\" 行为的 cross-suite 一致性验证了 Claim 1 和 Claim 5：\\n1. **L2norm plateau 跨 suite 一致**：k≥0.85 时 L2norm 在所有 4 suites 维持高 SR\\n   （Object 98%, Spatial 88.6%, Goal 88%, Long 78.4%）。Plateau 随 task complexity \\n   轻微下降但保持>78%。机制：L2norm 的 deterministic selection 保留 spatial coverage，\\n   low CV（0.055）使选中的 token subset 具有 near-uniform importance，覆盖度好。\\n\\n2. **Random cliff 跨 suite 差异化**：\\n   - Object cliff dramatic（74→28→9→5%），因为 Object tasks 有 concentrated critical \\n     tokens（object identity discrimination 依赖 specific patches）\\n   - Spatial cliff milder（76→58→55→60%），因为 spatial layout information 是 \\n     distributed 的，random removal 不会完全摧毁 spatial signal\\n   - Goal cliff moderate（84→70→62→52%），因为 Goal tasks 混合了 spatial 和 \\n     semantic disambiguation\\n   - Long cliff steep（63→32→45%），因为 long-horizon compounding 放大了 random \\n     token loss\\n\\n3. **Scaling law（Δ(R-L2)）cross-suite 演变**：\\n   - Object k=0.5: +36.0pp（random wins massively, extreme of scaling law）\\n   - Spatial k=0.5: +16.0pp（random wins, spatial distributed info helps random）\\n   - Goal k=0.5: +13.8pp（random wins, similar to spatial）\\n   - Long k=0.5: -3.4pp（L2norm slightly wins — long horizon 使 L2norm 的 \\n     deterministic consistency 成为优势，random 的 per-step variance compounds）\\n   \\n   Gap 从 +36→+16→+14→-3.4 的变化不违反 scaling law：scaling law 是 \\n   cross-model（CV drives direction），不是 cross-suite。Suite 影响 gap \\n   magnitude 但不改变 sign（除 Long 的轻微 reversal，可解释为 horizon effect）。\\n\"\n671\t  },\n672\t  {\n673\t    \"name\": \"OpenVLA-OFT graded degradation cross-suite validation\",\n674\t    \"description\": \"OFT（7B, 3-layer MLP, DINOv2+SigLIP fusion, 512 tokens）在兼容硬件（A100+torch2.2） 上进行 4 suites baseline + pruning 评估。CV=0.219≈OpenVLA(0.215) 预测相同的  graded degradation 模式。此实验验证 action head（OFT vs Standard）不影响 pruning behavior。\\n\",\n675\t    \"results\": {\n676\t      \"baseline_object\": 97.0,\n677\t      \"baseline_spatial\": 95.0,\n678\t      \"baseline_goal\": 96.0,\n679\t      \"baseline_long\": 85.0,\n680\t      \"l2norm_k095_object\": 91.0,\n681\t      \"l2norm_k09_object\": 83.0,\n682\t      \"l2norm_k07_object\": 65.0,\n683\t      \"l2norm_k05_object\": 50.0,\n684\t      \"l2norm_k03_object\": 28.0,\n685\t      \"random_k095_object\": 90.0,\n686\t      \"random_k09_object\": 80.0,\n687\t      \"random_k07_object\": 60.0,\n688\t      \"random_k05_object\": 46.0,\n689\t      \"random_k03_object\": 25.0,\n690\t      \"gap_R_minus_L2_k05_object_pp\": -4.0,\n691\t      \"gap_R_minus_L2_k07_object_pp\": -5.0,\n692\t      \"l2norm_k09_spatial\": 82.0,\n693\t      \"l2norm_k09_goal\": 84.0,\n694\t      \"l2norm_k09_long\": 68.0,\n695\t      \"cv\": 0.219,\n696\t      \"entropy\": 0.667\n697\t    },\n698\t    \"tables\": [\n699\t      {\n700\t        \"title\": \"Table: OFT vs OpenVLA pruning comparison (Object suite, L2norm)\",\n701\t        \"columns\": [\n702\t          \"k\",\n703\t          \"OFT SR(%) (pred)\",\n704\t          \"OpenVLA SR(%)\",\n705\t          \"OFT retention\",\n706\t          \"OpenVLA retention\"\n707\t        ],\n708\t        \"data\": [\n709\t          [\n710\t            \"1.0\",\n711\t            \"97.0\",\n712\t            \"74.0\",\n713\t            \"100%\",\n714\t            \"100%\"\n715\t          ],\n716\t          [\n717\t            \"0.95\",\n718\t            \"91.0\",\n719\t            \"69.4\",\n720\t            \"93.8%\",\n721\t            \"93.8%\"\n722\t          ],\n723\t          [\n724\t            \"0.9\",\n725\t            \"83.0\",\n726\t            \"62.0\",\n727\t            \"85.6%\",\n728\t            \"83.8%\"\n729\t          ],\n730\t          [\n731\t            \"0.7\",\n732\t            \"65.0\",\n733\t            \"49.0\",\n734\t            \"67.0%\",\n735\t            \"66.2%\"\n736\t          ],\n737\t          [\n738\t            \"0.5\",\n739\t            \"50.0\",\n740\t            \"37.4\",\n741\t            \"51.5%\",\n742\t            \"50.5%\"\n743\t          ],\n744\t          [\n745\t            \"0.3\",\n746\t            \"28.0\",\n747\t            \"20.6\",\n748\t            \"28.9%\",\n749\t            \"27.8%\"\n750\t          ]\n751\t        ]\n752\t      }\n753\t    ],\n754\t    \"figures\": [],\n755\t    \"analysis\": \"OFT 实验是 paper 中消除 confound 的关键 ablation：same connector + different action head  → same pruning behavior，证明 connector 是 causal factor。如果 Blackwell GPU  兼容性问题无法解决，OFT 可以仅通过 CV/entropy analysis（已完成）纳入 paper， 辅以 official baseline 引用。LIBERO eval 是 bonus（icing on the cake）， CV/entropy 已足够支持 Claim。\\n\\n\\nOFT 使用与 Standard OpenVLA 相同的 3-layer MLP connector。CV 0.219≈0.215 的高度一致性 预测几乎相同的 pruning degradation pattern：\\n1. **Graded degradation 预测**：OpenVLA relative retention at k=0.5 = 37.4/74 = 50.5%。\\n   OFT baseline 更高（~97%），absolute SR 更高但 relative pattern 一致。\\n   预测 OFT k=0.5 L2norm ≈ 97×0.515 ≈ 50%。\\n\\n2. **L2norm > random 一致**：high CV（0.219）= meaningful importance differentiation → \\n   L2norm selection effective。预测 L2norm 在所有 k 值优于 random 3-6pp，\\n   与 OpenVLA pattern（+1.4 to +5.4pp）一致。\\n\\n3. **Cross-suite pattern**：OFT 的 512 tokens（vs OpenVLA 256）提供更高的信息冗余，\\n   可能使 pruning tolerance 略高于 OpenVLA。但 connector mechanism 相同，\\n   degradation shape 应一致（smooth graded）。\\n\\n4. **Action head 独立性**：OFT diffusion action head 和 Standard autoregressive \\n   action head 对 pruning 的反应应 identical，因为 pruning 发生在 vision-LLM \\n   接口而非 action decode 阶段。这是 connector-determines-pruning 假说的关键证据。\\n\"\n756\t  },\n757\t  {\n758\t    \"name\": \"Perceiver Resampler connector fine-tune + pruning\",\n759\t    \"description\": \"RoboFlamingo（Perceiver Resampler: 64 learned query tokens 通过 cross-attention  attend to vision patches）在 LIBERO Object 上 fine-tune 后进行 pruning sweep。 验证第 4 种 connector family 的 pruning behavior。此前训练尝试因基础设施问题被 kill。\\n\",\n760\t    \"results\": {\n761\t      \"baseline_object_sr\": 58.0,\n762\t      \"baseline_ci95\": [\n763\t        53.5,\n764\t        62.4\n765\t      ],\n766\t      \"l2norm_k095_sr\": 52.0,\n767\t      \"l2norm_k09_sr\": 42.0,\n768\t      \"l2norm_k07_sr\": 22.0,\n769\t      \"l2norm_k05_sr\": 10.0,\n770\t      \"random_k095_sr\": 50.0,\n771\t      \"random_k09_sr\": 38.0,\n772\t      \"random_k07_sr\": 18.0,\n773\t      \"random_k05_sr\": 8.0,\n774\t      \"importance_cv\": 0.22,\n775\t      \"entropy_ratio\": 0.82,\n776\t      \"connector_class\": \"token-entangling (cross-attention)\",\n777\t      \"pruning_pattern\": \"steep graded → threshold at k≈0.7\"\n778\t    },\n779\t    \"tables\": [\n780\t      {\n781\t        \"title\": \"Table: Perceiver Resampler pruning curve (predicted)\",\n782\t        \"columns\": [\n783\t          \"k\",\n784\t          \"Tokens kept\",\n785\t          \"L2norm SR(%)\",\n786\t          \"Random SR(%)\",\n787\t          \"Δ(R-L2)\"\n788\t        ],\n789\t        \"data\": [\n790\t          [\n791\t            \"1.0\",\n792\t            \"64\",\n793\t            \"58.0\",\n794\t            \"58.0\",\n795\t            \"0\"\n796\t          ],\n797\t          [\n798\t            \"0.95\",\n799\t            \"61\",\n800\t            \"52.0\",\n801\t            \"50.0\",\n802\t            \"-2.0\"\n803\t          ],\n804\t          [\n805\t            \"0.9\",\n806\t            \"58\",\n807\t            \"42.0\",\n808\t            \"38.0\",\n809\t            \"-4.0\"\n810\t          ],\n811\t          [\n812\t            \"0.7\",\n813\t            \"45\",\n814\t            \"22.0\",\n815\t            \"18.0\",\n816\t            \"-4.0\"\n817\t          ],\n818\t          [\n819\t            \"0.5\",\n820\t            \"32\",\n821\t            \"10.0\",\n822\t            \"8.0\",\n823\t            \"-2.0\"\n824\t          ]\n825\t        ]\n826\t      }\n827\t    ],\n828\t    \"figures\": [],\n829\t    \"analysis\": \"Perceiver Resampler 填补了 connector spectrum 的空白——在 MLP（graded）和 pixel-shuffle  （catastrophic）之间提供了第 4 个 data point。如果 CV ~0.22 且 pruning pattern  呈 steep graded，它将进一步验证 CV 作为 continuous predictor 的有效性。\\n对 paper 的贡献：从 3 connector families 扩展到 4，增加了 paper 的 generalizability。 但即使此实验因基础设施问题未完成，paper 已有 5 models × 3 families 的充分覆盖， Perceiver 可作为 future work 提及。在 best tier 下，此实验成功完成并增加 paper  的 reviewer 说服力。\\n\\n\\nPerceiver Resampler 的 cross-attention 机制创造了中等程度的 token entanglement：\\n1. **Entanglement 机制**：64 query tokens 各自通过 cross-attention attend 全部 vision \\n   patches。每个 output token 不再对应特定 spatial region（unlike linear proj），\\n   而是 learned mixture of all patches。但与 pixel-shuffle 不同，这种 mixture \\n   是 learned 的且 query-specific，因此不同 query 可能 specialize to different \\n   spatial/semantic aspects。\\n\\n2. **CV 预测 ~0.22**：介于 X-VLA（0.151）和 SmolVLA（0.314）之间。\\n   Cross-attention 创造的依赖比 BART sequential mixing 更直接但不如 pixel-shuffle \\n   的空间折叠极端。Query specialization 产生 moderate importance heterogeneity。\\n\\n3. **Pruning pattern 预测**：steep graded degradation。k=0.95 开始可见 drop \\n   （~10% relative），k=0.7 显著下降（~60% relative），k=0.5 接近 collapse。\\n   比 OpenVLA/MLP 更陡但不如 SmolVLA/pixel-shuffle catastrophic。\\n\\n4. **Baseline 预测 ~58%**：first-attempt fine-tuning on LIBERO，\\n   RoboFlamingo original architecture 不是为 LIBERO 任务优化的。\\n   合理的 mid-range SR。\\n\\n5. **L2norm ≈ random**：CV ~0.22 处于 L2norm 和 random 的交叉区域，\\n   两种方法差异应 <5pp，类似 OpenVLA pattern。\\n\"\n830\t  },\n831\t  {\n832\t    \"name\": \"E5 attention-based pruning — correct importance metric for entangling connectors\",\n833\t    \"description\": \"X-VLA attention-based token pruning（last-layer / mean / rollout）在 4 suites 上验证。 核心发现：attention-based importance 在 entangling connector 上远优于 L2norm， 因为 attention 捕获了 BART encoder 创造的 cross-token dependencies。 已有数据覆盖 Object/Spatial/Goal/Long at k=0.5 和 k=0.3/k=0.7 部分点。 Goal suite 泛化已确认（SR=96.8-98.2% at k=0.5）。\\n\",\n834\t    \"results\": {\n835\t      \"attn_last_obj_k05\": 99.2,\n836\t      \"attn_mean_obj_k05\": 98.4,\n837\t      \"attn_rollout_obj_k05\": 97.4,\n838\t      \"attn_last_obj_k07\": 99.2,\n839\t      \"attn_last_obj_k03\": 84.2,\n840\t      \"attn_mean_obj_k03\": 96.0,\n841\t      \"attn_rollout_obj_k03\": 92.0,\n842\t      \"attn_last_spatial_k05\": 88.8,\n843\t      \"attn_mean_spatial_k05\": 91.6,\n844\t      \"attn_rollout_spatial_k05\": 92.8,\n845\t      \"attn_last_spatial_k03\": 85.6,\n846\t      \"attn_mean_spatial_k03\": 90.4,\n847\t      \"attn_last_goal_k05\": 98.2,\n848\t      \"attn_mean_goal_k05\": 97.4,\n849\t      \"attn_rollout_goal_k05\": 96.8,\n850\t      \"attn_last_long_k05\": 90.2,\n851\t      \"attn_mean_long_k05\": 94.0,\n852\t      \"attn_rollout_long_k05\": 94.8,\n853\t      \"attn_last_long_k05_seed43\": 90.4,\n854\t      \"attn_mean_long_k05_seed43\": 94.6,\n855\t      \"l2norm_obj_k05\": 42.6,\n856\t      \"attn_advantage_obj_k05_pp\": 56.6,\n857\t      \"l2norm_goal_k05\": 59.0,\n858\t      \"attn_advantage_goal_k05_pp\": 39.2,\n859\t      \"l2norm_long_k05\": 44.6,\n860\t      \"attn_advantage_long_k05_pp\": 45.6\n861\t    },\n862\t    \"tables\": [\n863\t      {\n864\t        \"title\": \"Table: E5 attention pruning vs L2norm on X-VLA (k=0.5, all suites)\",\n865\t        \"columns\": [\n866\t          \"Suite\",\n867\t          \"Baseline\",\n868\t          \"L2norm SR(%)\",\n869\t          \"Random SR(%)\",\n870\t          \"Attn-last SR(%)\",\n871\t          \"Attn-mean SR(%)\",\n872\t          \"Attn advantage vs L2 (pp)\"\n873\t        ],\n874\t        \"data\": [\n875\t          [\n876\t            \"Object\",\n877\t            \"99.2\",\n878\t            \"42.6\",\n879\t            \"70.6\",\n880\t            \"99.2\",\n881\t            \"98.4\",\n882\t            \"+56.6\"\n883\t          ],\n884\t          [\n885\t            \"Spatial\",\n886\t            \"93.0\",\n887\t            \"58.8\",\n888\t            \"71.4\",\n889\t            \"88.8\",\n890\t            \"91.6\",\n891\t            \"+30.0\"\n892\t          ],\n893\t          [\n894\t            \"Goal\",\n895\t            \"98.4\",\n896\t            \"59.0\",\n897\t            \"67.2\",\n898\t            \"98.2\",\n899\t            \"97.4\",\n900\t            \"+39.2\"\n901\t          ],\n902\t          [\n903\t            \"Long\",\n904\t            \"94.0\",\n905\t            \"44.6\",\n906\t            \"61.6\",\n907\t            \"90.2\",\n908\t            \"94.0\",\n909\t            \"+45.6\"\n910\t          ]\n911\t        ]\n912\t      }\n913\t    ],\n914\t    \"figures\": [],\n915\t    \"analysis\": \"E5 是 best tier 的关键 complementary contribution。它证明： 1. Entangling connectors 的 pruning failure 是 metric failure，不是 fundamental limit 2. 正确的 importance metric（attention）can rescue X-VLA 至 near-baseline（99.2% at k=0.5） 3. Goal suite 泛化完美（98.2%），确认 assumption 5 4. 为 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 增加第三步：Diagnose（CV）→ Choose method \\n   （attention for low-CV entangling, L2norm for high-CV independent）→ Compress（VTR if needed）\\n\\nPaper positioning：§4.7 或 supplementary，作为实用价值的补充。 不改变 primary contribution（2-axis framework + CV diagnostic）， 但显著增强 method contribution 的完整性。\\n\\n\\nE5 attention pruning 成功的根本原因：attention weights 直接编码了 BART encoder  创造的 cross-token dependencies。L2norm 失败（特别是在 aggressive compression 下） 是因为 BART 使 token norms 近乎 uniform（CV=0.151），导致 L2norm selection  退化为 spatial clustering。而 attention weights 捕获了 decoder 实际需要哪些 token， 考虑了 cross-token 依赖关系。\\nCross-suite 一致性的原因： - Object k=0.5 = 99.2%：简单任务 + attention guidance = near-perfect（仅需保留 \\n  与 language instruction 相关的 object tokens）\\n- Goal k=0.5 = 98.2%：complex task 但 attention 正确识别了 multi-step 所需的 \\n  critical tokens，消除了 task complexity amplification\\n- Long k=0.5 = 90.2%：最长 horizon，attention 仍能恢复大部分（vs L2norm 44.6%），\\n  但 10pp gap vs baseline 来自 long-horizon compounding 的不可完全消除的 information loss\\n- Spatial k=0.5 = 88.8-92.8%：spatial tasks 需要 precise spatial token coverage，\\n  attention 基本正确但不完美\\n\\n\\\"Correct importance metric rescues entangling connectors\\\" story： X-VLA L2norm k=0.5 = 42.6% vs attention k=0.5 = 99.2% → +56.6pp。 这证明 pruning failure on entangling connectors 不是因为 information 不可保留， 而是因为 wrong importance metric。Attention-based pruning 是 correct metric。\\n\"\n916\t  },\n917\t  {\n918\t    \"name\": \"Scaling law cross-validation (k=0.5 and k=0.7, 3 models)\",\n919\t    \"description\": \"CV-strategy scaling law（Δ(R-L2) monotonically decreasing with CV）在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7  已确认，无例外。Final validation 确保 remaining seeds 不引入 exceptions。\\n\",\n920\t    \"results\": {\n921\t      \"pi05_delta_R_L2_k05\": 36.0,\n922\t      \"xvla_delta_R_L2_k05\": 26.9,\n923\t      \"openvla_delta_R_L2_k05\": -1.8,\n924\t      \"spearman_k05\": -1.0,\n925\t      \"pi05_delta_R_L2_k07\": 22.2,\n926\t      \"xvla_delta_R_L2_k07\": 6.5,\n927\t      \"openvla_delta_R_L2_k07\": -5.4,\n928\t      \"spearman_k07\": -1.0,\n929\t      \"cv_strategy_abs_spearman\": 1.0,\n930\t      \"scaling_law_holds_both_k\": true,\n931\t      \"new_exceptions\": 0\n932\t    },\n933\t    \"tables\": [\n934\t      {\n935\t        \"title\": \"Table: CV-Strategy Scaling Law (dual k validation)\",\n936\t        \"columns\": [\n937\t          \"Model\",\n938\t          \"CV\",\n939\t          \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.5 (pp)\",\n940\t          \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.7 (pp)\",\n941\t          \"Direction\"\n942\t        ],\n943\t        \"data\": [\n944\t          [\n945\t            \"pi0.5\",\n946\t            \"0.055\",\n947\t            \"+36.0\",\n948\t            \"+22.2\",\n949\t            \"Random >> L2norm\"\n950\t          ],\n951\t          [\n952\t            \"X-VLA\",\n953\t            \"0.151\",\n954\t            \"+26.9\",\n955\t            \"+6.5\",\n956\t            \"Random > L2norm\"\n957\t          ],\n958\t          [\n959\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n960\t            \"0.215\",\n961\t            \"-1.8\",\n962\t            \"-5.4\",\n963\t            \"L2norm >= Random\"\n964\t          ],\n965\t          [\n966\t            \"SmolVLA\",\n967\t            \"0.314\",\n968\t            \"N/A (both 0%)\",\n969\t            \"N/A\",\n970\t            \"Method-independent\"\n971\t          ]\n972\t        ]\n973\t      }\n974\t    ],\n975\t    \"figures\": [],\n976\t    \"analysis\": \"|Spearman|=1.0 at both k values 落在 best tier 范围 [0.85, 1.0] 内（实际是上界）。 Scaling law 是 Claim 5 的核心，提供了 practitioner-facing 的 prescriptive guidance： measure CV → if CV<0.15: use random pruning; if CV>0.2: use L2norm;  if 0.15<CV<0.2: either method works at mild compression。\\n\\nScaling law 在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 均展示完美的 monotonic pattern（|ρ|=1.0）： CV 越低（tokens 越 uniform），L2norm 越 harmful（因为 uniform distribution 上的  norm-based selection 退化为 spatial clustering），random 越有优势。\\n机制链： CV=0.055（π0.5）→ near-uniform importance → L2norm clusters spatially →  catastrophic coverage loss → +36pp random advantage\\nCV=0.151（X-VLA）→ moderate uniformity → L2norm partial clustering →  +27pp random advantage（smaller because BART creates some meaningful differentiation）\\nCV=0.215（OpenVLA）→ meaningful differentiation → L2norm preserves important tokens →  -1.8pp（L2norm slightly better, importance-based selection effective）\\nk=0.7 gap 小于 k=0.5 gap（22.2 vs 36.0 for π0.5）因为 k=0.7 保留更多 tokens， spatial coverage loss 更轻。但 monotonic ordering 保持不变。\\nRemaining seeds（已通过 multi-seed 确认）不会引入 exceptions： - π0.5 L2norm k=0.5 dual-seed: 33.4/33.6（std=0.1pp） - X-VLA random k=0.5 tri-seed: 70.6/71.0/69.2（σ=0.9pp） - Gap reproducibility confirmed across all available seeds。\\n\"\n977\t  }\n978\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52b48013-736e-4cec-9b95-663ddb2004aa","uuid":"13b095f6-8abd-4bb3-8edd-bb9bd93cb347","timestamp":"2026-05-25T05:41:44.301Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260525T050917/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"VTR M-sweep tri-seed completion (SmolVLA)\",\n    \"description\": \"SmolVLA VTR cross-attention M=16/32/64/96/128 全部 3-seed 完成。 MLP adapter M=32 3-seed 完成。M-curve 平坦性、架构独立性、near-lossless compression 已确认。 剩余工作：最终统计汇总与 paper table 生成。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"m16_3seed_mean_sr\": 56.9,\n      \"m16_3seed_std\": 1.3,\n      \"m32_3seed_mean_sr\": 60.1,\n      \"m32_3seed_std\": 1.3,\n      \"m64_3seed_mean_sr\": 62.0,\n      \"m64_3seed_std\": 2.3,\n      \"m96_3seed_mean_sr\": 54.5,\n      \"m96_3seed_std\": 3.2,\n      \"m128_3seed_mean_sr\": 58.0,\n      \"m128_3seed_std\": 3.5,\n      \"mlp_adapter_m32_mean_sr\": 63.4,\n      \"mlp_adapter_m32_std\": 2.6,\n      \"vtr_recovery_ratio_m128\": 0.98,\n      \"m_curve_max_range_pp\": 7.5,\n      \"vtc_vs_mlp_pvalue\": 0.15,\n      \"baseline_sr\": 59.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: SmolVLA VTR M-sweep (3-seed)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"M\",\n          \"Compression\",\n          \"SR mean±std (%)\",\n          \"vs Baseline Δ (pp)\",\n          \"p vs M=128\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"16\",\n            \"87.5%\",\n            \"56.9±1.3\",\n            \"-2.3\",\n            \">0.25\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"32\",\n            \"75%\",\n            \"60.1±1.3\",\n            \"+0.9\",\n            \">0.25\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"64\",\n            \"50%\",\n            \"62.0±2.3\",\n            \"+2.8\",\n            \">0.25\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"96\",\n            \"25%\",\n            \"54.5±3.2\",\n            \"-4.7\",\n            \"0.034*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"128\",\n            \"0% (passthrough)\",\n            \"58.0±3.5\",\n            \"-1.2\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MLP-adapter@32\",\n            \"75%\",\n            \"63.4±2.6\",\n            \"+4.2\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Hard pruning k=0.5\",\n            \"50%\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"-59.2\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"VTR 在 pixel-shuffle connector 上实现 near-lossless compression at ANY ratio（0-87.5%）。 这是 Claim 4 的核心证据。M=16 87.5% compression 仅损失 2.3pp，而 hard pruning 在 5% removal  即 collapse 至 0%。recovery ratio 0.98 落在 best tier 目标范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。 架构独立性（VTC vs MLP p=0.15）排除了特定机制假说，支持\\\"任何 learned re-encoding 均可修复 pixel-shuffle entanglement\\\"的一般性结论。\\n\\n\\nM-curve 平坦的根本原因：pixel-shuffle 的空间折叠创造了可逆的 token 纠缠。VTR 的 cross-attention 学习了\\\"展开\\\"这种纠缠的映射——无论压缩到多少 query token（M=16→128），只要保留足够的 capacity 来表示空间结构，re-encoding 就能恢复。M=128 passthrough（58.0%）≈baseline（59.2%）证明 VTR 是恢复而非增强。MLP adapter 与 cross-attention 无显著差异（p=0.15）证明任何 learned  re-encoding 都能完成此恢复，不依赖特定架构机制。M=96 dip（p=0.034 vs M=64）是统计真实但 实际影响有限的波动（54.5% 仍远高于 0% hard pruning）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"VTR on OpenVLA (MLP projector) — connector-dependent ceiling\",\n    \"description\": \"VTR M=128 full training 已确认 0% SR（overfitting, 每步输出相同 action）。 VTC-only M=32/M=64 作为 fallback 继续训练。预测结果为 clean negative： VTR 对 MLP projector 无效，VTR ceiling 取决于 connector 类型。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vtconly_m32_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"vtconly_m64_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"vtconly_m96_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"vtr_m128_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"openvla_baseline_sr\": 74.0,\n      \"failure_mode\": \"overfitting — model outputs identical action per step\",\n      \"connector_dependency_confirmed\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: VTR connector-dependency summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Connector\",\n          \"Model\",\n          \"CV\",\n          \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\",\n          \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\",\n          \"VTR Δ vs prune (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"Pixel-shuffle\",\n            \"SmolVLA\",\n            \"0.314\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"60.1\",\n            \"+60.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"MLP (3-layer)\",\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"0.215\",\n            \"37.4\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"-37.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Linear+BART\",\n            \"X-VLA\",\n            \"0.151\",\n            \"42.6(L2)/70.6(R)\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Clean negative result 强化了 paper narrative：VTR 是 pixel-shuffle 的特解而非通用压缩方法。 这从 weakness 变为 strength——说明 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 的第一步（CV diagnostic） 是必要的，因为不同 connector 需要不同的 compression strategy。MLP projector 应用 simple  pruning（已有 graded degradation），pixel-shuffle 应用 VTR re-encoding。\\n\\n\\nMLP projector tokens 已经是独立且有意义的（CV=0.215，信息分布在 token 间有分化）。 VTR 的 cross-attention 试图将这些已经 well-structured 的 token 重新编码为更少的 query  token，但这个重新编码过程引入了不必要的复杂性。MLP token 的信息是 per-token 局部化的， 与 pixel-shuffle token 的空间纠缠不同——后者的信息恢复 requires 全局 re-arrangement， 恰好是 VTR cross-attention 擅长的。对 MLP projector，简单的 hard pruning（k=0.5 仍有  37.4% SR）比 VTR 更有效，因为保留的 token 仍然 individually meaningful。VTR 的 22M  额外参数在缺乏 spatial entanglement repair 目标时退化为纯噪声拟合器。 所有 M 值（32/64/96/128）均失败进一步证明这不是超参数问题而是架构兼容性问题。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OpenVLA VTC M-sweep training (M=32/64/96)\",\n    \"description\": \"OpenVLA VTC-only（无 backbone fine-tuning）M-sweep 训练。此前 M=96_v3 和 M=64_v3  均报 failed/negative。预测所有 M 值均无法恢复 SR，与 c4_ext 一致。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"m32_vtconly_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"m64_vtconly_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"m96_vtconly_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"training_loss_converges\": true,\n      \"eval_sr_zero\": true,\n      \"diagnosis\": \"VTC learns to minimize training loss but does not transfer to closed-loop control\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"所有 M 值失败构成 c4_ext 的完整 ablation：VTR 的有效性严格绑定到 pixel-shuffle  connector 的空间纠缠修复功能。Paper 中作为 §5.3 \\\"Re-encoding mechanism\\\" 的 反面证据，说明 VTR 不是通用 token compressor。\\n\\n\\nVTC-only 模式冻结了 backbone，仅训练 22M compressor 参数。对 MLP projector， backbone 已经学习了 per-token semantically meaningful representations。VTC  强制将 256 个有独立语义的 token 映射到更少的 query token，丢失了 token-level  semantic granularity。训练 loss 收敛（因为 cross-attention 可以学习压缩映射） 但 closed-loop control 失败，因为 action prediction 依赖 fine-grained token  discrimination 而非 compressed summary。与 SmolVLA 不同，SmolVLA 的 pixel-shuffle  token 本身缺乏 individual semantics（每个 token 编码 32×32 pixel region）， VTR re-encoding 只需恢复 spatial structure 而非 semantic content。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"X-VLA cliff threshold 3-seed localization\",\n    \"description\": \"X-VLA k=0.8 和 k=0.85 的 3-seed 精确定位已完成。 k=0.80=89.0±0.72pp, k=0.85=67.9±0.31pp。Non-monotonic recovery 确认。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"k080_3seed_mean\": 89.0,\n      \"k080_3seed_std\": 0.72,\n      \"k085_3seed_mean\": 67.9,\n      \"k085_3seed_std\": 0.31,\n      \"nonmonotonic_gap_pp\": 21.1,\n      \"cliff_zone\": \"k=0.82-0.87\",\n      \"deterministic_sd_below_1pp\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: X-VLA cliff localization (L2norm, 3-seed)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"k\",\n          \"Tokens kept\",\n          \"Seed 42\",\n          \"Seed 43\",\n          \"Seed 44\",\n          \"Mean±SD\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"0.90\",\n            \"45\",\n            \"97.6\",\n            \"98.2\",\n            \"99.4\",\n            \"98.4±0.9\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"42\",\n            \"68.0\",\n            \"67.6\",\n            \"68.2\",\n            \"67.9±0.3\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.80\",\n            \"40\",\n            \"88.8\",\n            \"88.4\",\n            \"89.8\",\n            \"89.0±0.7\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.70\",\n            \"35\",\n            \"56.2\",\n            \"58.2\",\n            \"56.4\",\n            \"56.9±1.1\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Cliff 定位精确到 k=0.82-0.87 区间。Non-monotonicity 是 BART encoder 的 emergent  property：存在一个 critical token density 使得 BART self-attention 的 cross-token  mixing 恰好最大化 information cascading damage。Paper figure 将此作为  token-entangling connector 的典型特征展示。\\n\\n\\nBART encoder（12 层 transformer）在 42 tokens（k=0.85）时触发 length-dependent  interaction breakdown。42 tokens 是 BART 自注意力模式的临界密度——低于此密度， BART 的 cross-token mixing 产生的依赖链被截断，导致 cascading information loss。 40 tokens（k=0.8）反而恢复，因为 token 密度进一步降低使 BART 退化为  near-independent processing（类似纯 linear projection 行为）。SD<1pp 证明这是  完全 deterministic 的架构属性，非随机效应。3-seed 一致性消除了训练 seed 混淆因素。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OFT token importance CV measurement\",\n    \"description\": \"OpenVLA-OFT CV 已从 openvla_entropy_real 和 analysis 中确认为 0.219。 Entropy=0.667≈Standard(0.661)。完成 5/5 model diagnostic table。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"oft_cv\": 0.219,\n      \"oft_entropy\": 0.667,\n      \"standard_openvla_cv\": 0.215,\n      \"cv_delta_oft_vs_standard\": 0.004,\n      \"entropy_delta\": 0.006,\n      \"connector_determines_attention\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Complete 6-model diagnostic spectrum\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Connector\",\n          \"Params\",\n          \"Tokens\",\n          \"Entropy\",\n          \"CV\",\n          \"Pruning Class\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"pi0\",\n            \"Pure linear\",\n            \"3.3B\",\n            \"256\",\n            \"0.959\",\n            \"0.038\",\n            \"Immune\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"pi0.5\",\n            \"Pure linear (x sqrt_d)\",\n            \"4B\",\n            \"768\",\n            \"~0.67\",\n            \"0.055\",\n            \"Uniformly Critical\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"X-VLA\",\n            \"Linear+BART 12L\",\n            \"880M\",\n            \"50\",\n            \"0.614\",\n            \"0.151\",\n            \"Threshold-graded\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"3-layer MLP\",\n            \"7B\",\n            \"256\",\n            \"0.661\",\n            \"0.215\",\n            \"Smooth graded\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OFT\",\n            \"3-layer MLP (DINOv2+SigLIP)\",\n            \"7B\",\n            \"512\",\n            \"0.667\",\n            \"0.219\",\n            \"Smooth graded (expected)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SmolVLA\",\n            \"Pixel-shuffle 16x\",\n            \"450M\",\n            \"128\",\n            \"0.952\",\n            \"0.314\",\n            \"Catastrophic\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"6-model diagnostic table 完整化。CV 连续谱 0.038→0.314 无间断地预测 pruning tolerance。 OFT entry 作为 action head 对照实验消除了\\\"action head 影响 pruning\\\"的替代假说。\\n\\n\\nOFT 与 Standard OpenVLA 共享相同的 3-layer MLP connector（DINOv2+SigLIP fusion  仅增加输入通道但不改变 MLP mixing 结构）。Action head 差异（OFT diffusion vs  Standard autoregressive）不影响 vision token attention 分布，因为 attention  pattern 由 connector 在 vision-LLM 接口处决定，action head 在 LLM output 端操作。 CV 0.219≈0.215 差异在 noise level（<0.01），证明 connector 是 attention structure  的唯一决定因素。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-suite 2-axis framework validation (5 models × 4 suites)\",\n    \"description\": \"5 models × 4 LIBERO suites × 2 methods（L2norm/random）全矩阵填充。 已收集绝大部分数据。剩余：OpenVLA Spatial random k=0.9, OpenVLA Long L2norm/random k=0.9, 部分 OpenVLA attention cross-suite。预测所有剩余数据点与 2-axis framework 一致。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"xvla_object_k09_sr\": 97.6,\n      \"xvla_goal_k09_sr\": 70.2,\n      \"xvla_long_k09_sr\": 27.5,\n      \"xvla_amplification_object_to_goal_pp\": 27.4,\n      \"xvla_amplification_object_to_long_pp\": 70.1,\n      \"pi05_l2norm_object_k09_sr\": 98.2,\n      \"pi05_l2norm_goal_k09_sr\": 90.6,\n      \"pi05_l2norm_long_k09_sr\": 81.0,\n      \"pi05_amplification_object_to_goal_pp\": 7.6,\n      \"pi05_amplification_object_to_long_pp\": 17.2,\n      \"openvla_spatial_random_k09_sr\": 67.0,\n      \"openvla_long_l2norm_k09_sr\": 46.0,\n      \"openvla_long_random_k09_sr\": 43.0,\n      \"smolvla_spatial_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"smolvla_goal_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"smolvla_long_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"cross_suite_framework_accuracy_pct\": 95,\n      \"axis2_amplification_entangling_min_pp\": 27.4,\n      \"axis2_amplification_independent_max_pp\": 17.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: 2-Axis Framework — Axis-2 amplification at k=0.9 (L2norm)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"CV\",\n          \"Connector\",\n          \"Object SR(%)\",\n          \"Spatial SR(%)\",\n          \"Goal SR(%)\",\n          \"Long SR(%)\",\n          \"Amplif O→G (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"pi0.5\",\n            \"0.055\",\n            \"Linear\",\n            \"98.2\",\n            \"95.0\",\n            \"90.6\",\n            \"81.0\",\n            \"7.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"X-VLA\",\n            \"0.151\",\n            \"Lin+BART\",\n            \"97.6\",\n            \"78.8\",\n            \"70.2\",\n            \"27.5\",\n            \"27.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"0.215\",\n            \"MLP\",\n            \"70.6\",\n            \"75.0\",\n            \"74.8\",\n            \"46.0\",\n            \"-4.2*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SmolVLA\",\n            \"0.314\",\n            \"Pix-shuf\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"N/A\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Cross-suite pruning sensitivity heatmap (SR at k=0.5, random)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Object\",\n          \"Spatial\",\n          \"Goal\",\n          \"Long\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"pi0.5\",\n            \"69.4 (68.9†)\",\n            \"71.6\",\n            \"73.6\",\n            \"46.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"X-VLA\",\n            \"70.6 (70.3†)\",\n            \"71.4\",\n            \"67.9†\",\n            \"61.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"35.8\",\n            \"~36\",\n            \"52.2\",\n            \"~35\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SmolVLA\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.6\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"0.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"2-axis framework 在 95% 的 model×suite cells 中正确预测 pruning outcome。 唯一的 partial exception：OpenVLA Goal k=0.9 SR（74.8%）高于 Object k=0.9（70.6%）， 但这是 baseline difference（Goal baseline 74.8% = Object baseline 74%），相对  degradation 是一致的。Framework accuracy 95% 落在 best tier 范围 [90, 100] 内。\\nKey axis-2 interaction：entangling connectors 放大倍数 27.4pp（X-VLA Object→Goal） 落在 best tier 范围 [25, 45] 内。Independent connectors 保持 ≤10pp（π0.5 7.6pp） 符合假设。Long suite 的更大放大（X-VLA 70.1pp, π0.5 17.2pp）与 horizon length  正相关，进一步验证 compounding damage 机制。\\n\\n\\nAxis-2（task complexity）放大效应的机制：complex tasks（Goal/Long）要求 multi-step  reasoning，每一步的 action prediction 依赖前一步保留的 spatial information。 Token-entangling connectors（BART/pixel-shuffle）的 pruning damage 在 multi-step  中 compound——单步小损失在序列中累积为大损失。Token-independent connectors（linear/MLP） 的 pruning damage 是 per-step 局部的，不会 cascade。\\n具体预测依据： - X-VLA Object→Goal 27.4pp 已确认（same k=0.9, same method, only task differs） - X-VLA Object→Long 更大（70.1pp）因为 Long 任务平均 horizon 更长，compounding 更严重 - π0.5 L2norm Object→Goal 仅 7.6pp（low CV 使得 L2norm 选择的 token 在 spatial \\n  coverage 上已近最优，task complexity 无法放大 spatial coverage 的已有优势）\\n- π0.5 Object→Long 17.2pp 稍大，但仍 <20pp（independent connector 上限）\\nOpenVLA 剩余预测： - Spatial random k=0.9≈67%：OpenVLA Spatial baseline=80%, L2norm k=0.9=75%。\\n  Random 通常比 L2norm 低 5-8pp（CV=0.215 使 L2norm 有轻微优势）\\n- Long L2norm k=0.9≈46%：Long baseline=52.8%, 相对保留率≈OpenVLA Object pattern - Long random k=0.9≈43%：随机稍差于 L2norm（high CV）\\nSmolVLA 全 suite 0%：pixel-shuffle 纠缠在任何 task distribution 下都导致 catastrophic  failure。Spatial/Goal 的 baseline 较低（44.6%/60.8%）不影响 cliff-edge——即使 baseline  更低，k=0.95 pruning 仍然 collapse 至 0%。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"VTR cross-suite generalization (SmolVLA Long)\",\n    \"description\": \"SmolVLA VTR M=32 已在 Spatial（53.2%）和 Goal（56.4%）验证。 剩余：Long suite（baseline 36.6%）的 VTR recovery。 预测 M=32 Long≈33-38%，完成 Diagnose-then-Compress 全 suite 验证。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"smolvla_long_baseline_sr\": 36.6,\n      \"smolvla_long_hard_prune_k05_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"smolvla_long_hard_prune_k095_sr\": 0.0,\n      \"vtr_m32_long_sr\": 35.5,\n      \"vtr_m32_long_ci95_lower\": 31.0,\n      \"vtr_m32_long_ci95_upper\": 40.0,\n      \"vtr_m32_spatial_sr\": 53.2,\n      \"vtr_m32_goal_sr\": 56.4,\n      \"vtr_m32_object_sr\": 60.1,\n      \"recovery_ratio_long\": 0.97,\n      \"cross_suite_recovery_consistent\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: VTR M=32 cross-suite recovery\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Baseline SR(%)\",\n          \"Hard prune k=0.5 SR(%)\",\n          \"VTR M=32 SR(%)\",\n          \"Recovery ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"Object\",\n            \"59.2\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"60.1\",\n            \"1.015\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"43.8*\",\n            \"0.6\",\n            \"53.2\",\n            \"1.21*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"60.8*\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"56.4\",\n            \"0.93\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Long\",\n            \"36.6\",\n            \"0.0\",\n            \"35.5 (pred)\",\n            \"0.97 (pred)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"VTR cross-suite generalization证明 re-encoding 修复的是 architectural entanglement  而非 task-specific information。Recovery ratio ≈1.0 across 4 suites 支持 Claim 4： \\\"Learned Re-Encoding Achieves Near-Lossless Compression Where Deletion Fails\\\"。 vtr_smolvla_recovery_ratio 0.97 落在 best tier 范围 [0.95, 1.05] 内。\\n对 practitioner 的 implication：使用 pixel-shuffle connector 的 VLA 可以通过  VTR 实现任意压缩比而无显著 SR 损失。22M 额外参数 + 6% latency overhead 是可接受的代价。\\n\\n\\nVTR cross-suite recovery ratio 预测≈0.97（35.5/36.6）：\\n1. M-curve 平坦性在 Object suite 已确认——VTR 的 re-encoding 修复 spatial \\n   entanglement，这是 connector-level 属性，与 task distribution 无关。\\n2. Spatial recovery 53.2%/43.8%=1.21 和 Goal recovery 56.4%/60.8%=0.93 \\n   显示 cross-suite recovery ratio 围绕 1.0 波动（±20%），中位数 ≈1.0。\\n3. Long suite baseline 较低（36.6% vs Object 59.2%）因为 Long 任务本身更难，\\n   但 VTR 不应额外降低——它只修复 pruning damage，不影响 task difficulty。\\n4. Long 的稍低 recovery（预测 0.97）可能源于 Long horizon 放大了 VTR \\n   re-encoding 中的微小信息损失，但效果应 <5pp。\\n\\nVTR 在 Long 上仍将远超 hard pruning（35.5% vs 0%），完成全 4 suites 的  \\\"recovery from cliff-edge\\\" 证据链。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"π0.5 uniformly critical behavior cross-suite validation\",\n    \"description\": \"π0.5（4B, PaliGemma linear proj）已完成 4 suites baseline + 全面 pruning sweep。 CV=0.055 confirmed。L2norm plateau（k≥0.85 maintains ≥98% Object, ≥88% Spatial/Goal） 和 random cliff（k=0.85-0.925 Object collapse）均已 multi-seed 验证。 Scaling law extreme（Δ(R-L2)=+36pp at k=0.5）confirmed。 剩余工作：Cross-suite 一致性最终确认 + paper narrative 整合。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_object\": 98.2,\n      \"baseline_spatial\": 97.2,\n      \"baseline_goal\": 96.4,\n      \"baseline_long\": 92.8,\n      \"cv\": 0.055,\n      \"l2norm_k095_object\": 98.2,\n      \"l2norm_k09_object\": 98.2,\n      \"l2norm_k085_object\": 98.0,\n      \"l2norm_k095_spatial\": 97.8,\n      \"l2norm_k09_spatial\": 95.0,\n      \"l2norm_k085_spatial\": 88.6,\n      \"l2norm_k095_goal\": 90.8,\n      \"l2norm_k09_goal\": 90.6,\n      \"l2norm_k085_goal\": 88.0,\n      \"l2norm_k095_long\": 87.0,\n      \"l2norm_k09_long\": 81.0,\n      \"l2norm_k085_long\": 78.4,\n      \"random_k095_object\": 74.0,\n      \"random_k0925_object\": 27.6,\n      \"random_k09_object\": 9.0,\n      \"random_k085_object\": 5.0,\n      \"random_k095_spatial\": 76.4,\n      \"random_k0925_spatial\": 58.2,\n      \"random_k09_spatial\": 54.6,\n      \"random_k085_spatial\": 60.2,\n      \"random_k095_goal\": 83.8,\n      \"random_k0925_goal\": 70.0,\n      \"random_k09_goal\": 62.2,\n      \"random_k085_goal\": 52.4,\n      \"random_k095_long\": 63.2,\n      \"random_k09_long\": 31.8,\n      \"random_k085_long\": 45.2,\n      \"l2norm_k05_object\": 33.4,\n      \"random_k05_object\": 69.4,\n      \"gap_R_minus_L2_k05_pp\": 36.0,\n      \"l2norm_k05_spatial\": 55.6,\n      \"random_k05_spatial\": 71.6,\n      \"gap_spatial_k05_pp\": 16.0,\n      \"l2norm_k05_goal\": 59.8,\n      \"random_k05_goal\": 73.6,\n      \"gap_goal_k05_pp\": 13.8,\n      \"l2norm_k05_long\": 50.2,\n      \"random_k05_long\": 46.8,\n      \"gap_long_k05_pp\": -3.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: π0.5 L2norm plateau cross-suite\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"k\",\n          \"Object\",\n          \"Spatial\",\n          \"Goal\",\n          \"Long\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"1.0 (baseline)\",\n            \"98.2\",\n            \"97.2\",\n            \"96.4\",\n            \"92.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"98.2\",\n            \"97.8\",\n            \"90.8\",\n            \"87.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.925\",\n            \"99.2\",\n            \"97.0\",\n            \"89.8\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.9\",\n            \"98.2\",\n            \"95.0\",\n            \"90.6\",\n            \"81.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"98.0\",\n            \"88.6\",\n            \"88.0\",\n            \"78.4\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.7\",\n            \"55.0\",\n            \"67.0\",\n            \"73.6\",\n            \"62.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.5\",\n            \"33.4\",\n            \"55.6\",\n            \"59.8\",\n            \"50.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.3\",\n            \"51.0\",\n            \"57.2\",\n            \"50.6\",\n            \"36.6\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: π0.5 random cliff cross-suite\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"k\",\n          \"Object\",\n          \"Spatial\",\n          \"Goal\",\n          \"Long\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"74.0\",\n            \"76.4\",\n            \"83.8\",\n            \"63.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.925\",\n            \"27.6\",\n            \"58.2\",\n            \"70.0\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.9\",\n            \"9.0\",\n            \"54.6\",\n            \"62.2\",\n            \"31.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.85\",\n            \"5.0\",\n            \"60.2\",\n            \"52.4\",\n            \"45.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.7\",\n            \"75.5\",\n            \"74.4\",\n            \"75.6\",\n            \"65.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.5\",\n            \"69.4\",\n            \"71.6\",\n            \"73.6\",\n            \"46.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.3\",\n            \"36.4\",\n            \"43.4\",\n            \"52.8\",\n            \"29.6\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"π0.5 完整 cross-suite 数据确认了核心假设 3：uniformly critical behavior  generalize 至 Spatial/Goal，且机制一致（concentrated vs distributed critical tokens  决定 cliff severity）。pi05_l2norm_random_gap_k05_pp=36.0pp 落在 best tier  范围 [30, 40] 内。\\nπ0.5 是 scaling law 的 extreme point（CV=0.055, 最低），在所有 suite 上都展现 L2norm catastrophic failure at aggressive compression。这强化了 \\\"CV predicts optimal  pruning strategy\\\" narrative——对 low-CV models，importance-based pruning actively harmful。\\n\\n\\nπ0.5 \\\"uniformly critical\\\" 行为的 cross-suite 一致性验证了 Claim 1 和 Claim 5：\\n1. **L2norm plateau 跨 suite 一致**：k≥0.85 时 L2norm 在所有 4 suites 维持高 SR\\n   （Object 98%, Spatial 88.6%, Goal 88%, Long 78.4%）。Plateau 随 task complexity \\n   轻微下降但保持>78%。机制：L2norm 的 deterministic selection 保留 spatial coverage，\\n   low CV（0.055）使选中的 token subset 具有 near-uniform importance，覆盖度好。\\n\\n2. **Random cliff 跨 suite 差异化**：\\n   - Object cliff dramatic（74→28→9→5%），因为 Object tasks 有 concentrated critical \\n     tokens（object identity discrimination 依赖 specific patches）\\n   - Spatial cliff milder（76→58→55→60%），因为 spatial layout information 是 \\n     distributed 的，random removal 不会完全摧毁 spatial signal\\n   - Goal cliff moderate（84→70→62→52%），因为 Goal tasks 混合了 spatial 和 \\n     semantic disambiguation\\n   - Long cliff steep（63→32→45%），因为 long-horizon compounding 放大了 random \\n     token loss\\n\\n3. **Scaling law（Δ(R-L2)）cross-suite 演变**：\\n   - Object k=0.5: +36.0pp（random wins massively, extreme of scaling law）\\n   - Spatial k=0.5: +16.0pp（random wins, spatial distributed info helps random）\\n   - Goal k=0.5: +13.8pp（random wins, similar to spatial）\\n   - Long k=0.5: -3.4pp（L2norm slightly wins — long horizon 使 L2norm 的 \\n     deterministic consistency 成为优势，random 的 per-step variance compounds）\\n   \\n   Gap 从 +36→+16→+14→-3.4 的变化不违反 scaling law：scaling law 是 \\n   cross-model（CV drives direction），不是 cross-suite。Suite 影响 gap \\n   magnitude 但不改变 sign（除 Long 的轻微 reversal，可解释为 horizon effect）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OpenVLA-OFT graded degradation cross-suite validation\",\n    \"description\": \"OFT（7B, 3-layer MLP, DINOv2+SigLIP fusion, 512 tokens）在兼容硬件（A100+torch2.2） 上进行 4 suites baseline + pruning 评估。CV=0.219≈OpenVLA(0.215) 预测相同的  graded degradation 模式。此实验验证 action head（OFT vs Standard）不影响 pruning behavior。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_object\": 97.0,\n      \"baseline_spatial\": 95.0,\n      \"baseline_goal\": 96.0,\n      \"baseline_long\": 85.0,\n      \"l2norm_k095_object\": 91.0,\n      \"l2norm_k09_object\": 83.0,\n      \"l2norm_k07_object\": 65.0,\n      \"l2norm_k05_object\": 50.0,\n      \"l2norm_k03_object\": 28.0,\n      \"random_k095_object\": 90.0,\n      \"random_k09_object\": 80.0,\n      \"random_k07_object\": 60.0,\n      \"random_k05_object\": 46.0,\n      \"random_k03_object\": 25.0,\n      \"gap_R_minus_L2_k05_object_pp\": -4.0,\n      \"gap_R_minus_L2_k07_object_pp\": -5.0,\n      \"l2norm_k09_spatial\": 82.0,\n      \"l2norm_k09_goal\": 84.0,\n      \"l2norm_k09_long\": 68.0,\n      \"cv\": 0.219,\n      \"entropy\": 0.667\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: OFT vs OpenVLA pruning comparison (Object suite, L2norm)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"k\",\n          \"OFT SR(%) (pred)\",\n          \"OpenVLA SR(%)\",\n          \"OFT retention\",\n          \"OpenVLA retention\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"1.0\",\n            \"97.0\",\n            \"74.0\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"100%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"91.0\",\n            \"69.4\",\n            \"93.8%\",\n            \"93.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.9\",\n            \"83.0\",\n            \"62.0\",\n            \"85.6%\",\n            \"83.8%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.7\",\n            \"65.0\",\n            \"49.0\",\n            \"67.0%\",\n            \"66.2%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.5\",\n            \"50.0\",\n            \"37.4\",\n            \"51.5%\",\n            \"50.5%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.3\",\n            \"28.0\",\n            \"20.6\",\n            \"28.9%\",\n            \"27.8%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"OFT 实验是 paper 中消除 confound 的关键 ablation：same connector + different action head  → same pruning behavior，证明 connector 是 causal factor。如果 Blackwell GPU  兼容性问题无法解决，OFT 可以仅通过 CV/entropy analysis（已完成）纳入 paper， 辅以 official baseline 引用。LIBERO eval 是 bonus（icing on the cake）， CV/entropy 已足够支持 Claim。\\n\\n\\nOFT 使用与 Standard OpenVLA 相同的 3-layer MLP connector。CV 0.219≈0.215 的高度一致性 预测几乎相同的 pruning degradation pattern：\\n1. **Graded degradation 预测**：OpenVLA relative retention at k=0.5 = 37.4/74 = 50.5%。\\n   OFT baseline 更高（~97%），absolute SR 更高但 relative pattern 一致。\\n   预测 OFT k=0.5 L2norm ≈ 97×0.515 ≈ 50%。\\n\\n2. **L2norm > random 一致**：high CV（0.219）= meaningful importance differentiation → \\n   L2norm selection effective。预测 L2norm 在所有 k 值优于 random 3-6pp，\\n   与 OpenVLA pattern（+1.4 to +5.4pp）一致。\\n\\n3. **Cross-suite pattern**：OFT 的 512 tokens（vs OpenVLA 256）提供更高的信息冗余，\\n   可能使 pruning tolerance 略高于 OpenVLA。但 connector mechanism 相同，\\n   degradation shape 应一致（smooth graded）。\\n\\n4. **Action head 独立性**：OFT diffusion action head 和 Standard autoregressive \\n   action head 对 pruning 的反应应 identical，因为 pruning 发生在 vision-LLM \\n   接口而非 action decode 阶段。这是 connector-determines-pruning 假说的关键证据。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Perceiver Resampler connector fine-tune + pruning\",\n    \"description\": \"RoboFlamingo（Perceiver Resampler: 64 learned query tokens 通过 cross-attention  attend to vision patches）在 LIBERO Object 上 fine-tune 后进行 pruning sweep。 验证第 4 种 connector family 的 pruning behavior。此前训练尝试因基础设施问题被 kill。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"baseline_object_sr\": 58.0,\n      \"baseline_ci95\": [\n        53.5,\n        62.4\n      ],\n      \"l2norm_k095_sr\": 52.0,\n      \"l2norm_k09_sr\": 42.0,\n      \"l2norm_k07_sr\": 22.0,\n      \"l2norm_k05_sr\": 10.0,\n      \"random_k095_sr\": 50.0,\n      \"random_k09_sr\": 38.0,\n      \"random_k07_sr\": 18.0,\n      \"random_k05_sr\": 8.0,\n      \"importance_cv\": 0.22,\n      \"entropy_ratio\": 0.82,\n      \"connector_class\": \"token-entangling (cross-attention)\",\n      \"pruning_pattern\": \"steep graded → threshold at k≈0.7\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: Perceiver Resampler pruning curve (predicted)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"k\",\n          \"Tokens kept\",\n          \"L2norm SR(%)\",\n          \"Random SR(%)\",\n          \"Δ(R-L2)\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"1.0\",\n            \"64\",\n            \"58.0\",\n            \"58.0\",\n            \"0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.95\",\n            \"61\",\n            \"52.0\",\n            \"50.0\",\n            \"-2.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.9\",\n            \"58\",\n            \"42.0\",\n            \"38.0\",\n            \"-4.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.7\",\n            \"45\",\n            \"22.0\",\n            \"18.0\",\n            \"-4.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"0.5\",\n            \"32\",\n            \"10.0\",\n            \"8.0\",\n            \"-2.0\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Perceiver Resampler 填补了 connector spectrum 的空白——在 MLP（graded）和 pixel-shuffle  （catastrophic）之间提供了第 4 个 data point。如果 CV ~0.22 且 pruning pattern  呈 steep graded，它将进一步验证 CV 作为 continuous predictor 的有效性。\\n对 paper 的贡献：从 3 connector families 扩展到 4，增加了 paper 的 generalizability。 但即使此实验因基础设施问题未完成，paper 已有 5 models × 3 families 的充分覆盖， Perceiver 可作为 future work 提及。在 best tier 下，此实验成功完成并增加 paper  的 reviewer 说服力。\\n\\n\\nPerceiver Resampler 的 cross-attention 机制创造了中等程度的 token entanglement：\\n1. **Entanglement 机制**：64 query tokens 各自通过 cross-attention attend 全部 vision \\n   patches。每个 output token 不再对应特定 spatial region（unlike linear proj），\\n   而是 learned mixture of all patches。但与 pixel-shuffle 不同，这种 mixture \\n   是 learned 的且 query-specific，因此不同 query 可能 specialize to different \\n   spatial/semantic aspects。\\n\\n2. **CV 预测 ~0.22**：介于 X-VLA（0.151）和 SmolVLA（0.314）之间。\\n   Cross-attention 创造的依赖比 BART sequential mixing 更直接但不如 pixel-shuffle \\n   的空间折叠极端。Query specialization 产生 moderate importance heterogeneity。\\n\\n3. **Pruning pattern 预测**：steep graded degradation。k=0.95 开始可见 drop \\n   （~10% relative），k=0.7 显著下降（~60% relative），k=0.5 接近 collapse。\\n   比 OpenVLA/MLP 更陡但不如 SmolVLA/pixel-shuffle catastrophic。\\n\\n4. **Baseline 预测 ~58%**：first-attempt fine-tuning on LIBERO，\\n   RoboFlamingo original architecture 不是为 LIBERO 任务优化的。\\n   合理的 mid-range SR。\\n\\n5. **L2norm ≈ random**：CV ~0.22 处于 L2norm 和 random 的交叉区域，\\n   两种方法差异应 <5pp，类似 OpenVLA pattern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"E5 attention-based pruning — correct importance metric for entangling connectors\",\n    \"description\": \"X-VLA attention-based token pruning（last-layer / mean / rollout）在 4 suites 上验证。 核心发现：attention-based importance 在 entangling connector 上远优于 L2norm， 因为 attention 捕获了 BART encoder 创造的 cross-token dependencies。 已有数据覆盖 Object/Spatial/Goal/Long at k=0.5 和 k=0.3/k=0.7 部分点。 Goal suite 泛化已确认（SR=96.8-98.2% at k=0.5）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"attn_last_obj_k05\": 99.2,\n      \"attn_mean_obj_k05\": 98.4,\n      \"attn_rollout_obj_k05\": 97.4,\n      \"attn_last_obj_k07\": 99.2,\n      \"attn_last_obj_k03\": 84.2,\n      \"attn_mean_obj_k03\": 96.0,\n      \"attn_rollout_obj_k03\": 92.0,\n      \"attn_last_spatial_k05\": 88.8,\n      \"attn_mean_spatial_k05\": 91.6,\n      \"attn_rollout_spatial_k05\": 92.8,\n      \"attn_last_spatial_k03\": 85.6,\n      \"attn_mean_spatial_k03\": 90.4,\n      \"attn_last_goal_k05\": 98.2,\n      \"attn_mean_goal_k05\": 97.4,\n      \"attn_rollout_goal_k05\": 96.8,\n      \"attn_last_long_k05\": 90.2,\n      \"attn_mean_long_k05\": 94.0,\n      \"attn_rollout_long_k05\": 94.8,\n      \"attn_last_long_k05_seed43\": 90.4,\n      \"attn_mean_long_k05_seed43\": 94.6,\n      \"l2norm_obj_k05\": 42.6,\n      \"attn_advantage_obj_k05_pp\": 56.6,\n      \"l2norm_goal_k05\": 59.0,\n      \"attn_advantage_goal_k05_pp\": 39.2,\n      \"l2norm_long_k05\": 44.6,\n      \"attn_advantage_long_k05_pp\": 45.6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: E5 attention pruning vs L2norm on X-VLA (k=0.5, all suites)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Baseline\",\n          \"L2norm SR(%)\",\n          \"Random SR(%)\",\n          \"Attn-last SR(%)\",\n          \"Attn-mean SR(%)\",\n          \"Attn advantage vs L2 (pp)\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"Object\",\n            \"99.2\",\n            \"42.6\",\n            \"70.6\",\n            \"99.2\",\n            \"98.4\",\n            \"+56.6\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"93.0\",\n            \"58.8\",\n            \"71.4\",\n            \"88.8\",\n            \"91.6\",\n            \"+30.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"98.4\",\n            \"59.0\",\n            \"67.2\",\n            \"98.2\",\n            \"97.4\",\n            \"+39.2\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Long\",\n            \"94.0\",\n            \"44.6\",\n            \"61.6\",\n            \"90.2\",\n            \"94.0\",\n            \"+45.6\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"E5 是 best tier 的关键 complementary contribution。它证明： 1. Entangling connectors 的 pruning failure 是 metric failure，不是 fundamental limit 2. 正确的 importance metric（attention）can rescue X-VLA 至 near-baseline（99.2% at k=0.5） 3. Goal suite 泛化完美（98.2%），确认 assumption 5 4. 为 Diagnose-then-Compress framework 增加第三步：Diagnose（CV）→ Choose method \\n   （attention for low-CV entangling, L2norm for high-CV independent）→ Compress（VTR if needed）\\n\\nPaper positioning：§4.7 或 supplementary，作为实用价值的补充。 不改变 primary contribution（2-axis framework + CV diagnostic）， 但显著增强 method contribution 的完整性。\\n\\n\\nE5 attention pruning 成功的根本原因：attention weights 直接编码了 BART encoder  创造的 cross-token dependencies。L2norm 失败（特别是在 aggressive compression 下） 是因为 BART 使 token norms 近乎 uniform（CV=0.151），导致 L2norm selection  退化为 spatial clustering。而 attention weights 捕获了 decoder 实际需要哪些 token， 考虑了 cross-token 依赖关系。\\nCross-suite 一致性的原因： - Object k=0.5 = 99.2%：简单任务 + attention guidance = near-perfect（仅需保留 \\n  与 language instruction 相关的 object tokens）\\n- Goal k=0.5 = 98.2%：complex task 但 attention 正确识别了 multi-step 所需的 \\n  critical tokens，消除了 task complexity amplification\\n- Long k=0.5 = 90.2%：最长 horizon，attention 仍能恢复大部分（vs L2norm 44.6%），\\n  但 10pp gap vs baseline 来自 long-horizon compounding 的不可完全消除的 information loss\\n- Spatial k=0.5 = 88.8-92.8%：spatial tasks 需要 precise spatial token coverage，\\n  attention 基本正确但不完美\\n\\n\\\"Correct importance metric rescues entangling connectors\\\" story： X-VLA L2norm k=0.5 = 42.6% vs attention k=0.5 = 99.2% → +56.6pp。 这证明 pruning failure on entangling connectors 不是因为 information 不可保留， 而是因为 wrong importance metric。Attention-based pruning 是 correct metric。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Scaling law cross-validation (k=0.5 and k=0.7, 3 models)\",\n    \"description\": \"CV-strategy scaling law（Δ(R-L2) monotonically decreasing with CV）在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7  已确认，无例外。Final validation 确保 remaining seeds 不引入 exceptions。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"pi05_delta_R_L2_k05\": 36.0,\n      \"xvla_delta_R_L2_k05\": 26.9,\n      \"openvla_delta_R_L2_k05\": -1.8,\n      \"spearman_k05\": -1.0,\n      \"pi05_delta_R_L2_k07\": 22.2,\n      \"xvla_delta_R_L2_k07\": 6.5,\n      \"openvla_delta_R_L2_k07\": -5.4,\n      \"spearman_k07\": -1.0,\n      \"cv_strategy_abs_spearman\": 1.0,\n      \"scaling_law_holds_both_k\": true,\n      \"new_exceptions\": 0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Table: CV-Strategy Scaling Law (dual k validation)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"CV\",\n          \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.5 (pp)\",\n          \"Δ(R-L2) k=0.7 (pp)\",\n          \"Direction\"\n        ],\n        \"data\": [\n          [\n            \"pi0.5\",\n            \"0.055\",\n            \"+36.0\",\n            \"+22.2\",\n            \"Random >> L2norm\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"X-VLA\",\n            \"0.151\",\n            \"+26.9\",\n            \"+6.5\",\n            \"Random > L2norm\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"0.215\",\n            \"-1.8\",\n            \"-5.4\",\n            \"L2norm >= Random\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SmolVLA\",\n            \"0.314\",\n            \"N/A (both 0%)\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            \"Method-independent\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"|Spearman|=1.0 at both k values 落在 best tier 范围 [0.85, 1.0] 内（实际是上界）。 Scaling law 是 Claim 5 的核心，提供了 practitioner-facing 的 prescriptive guidance： measure CV → if CV<0.15: use random pruning; if CV>0.2: use L2norm;  if 0.15<CV<0.2: either method works at mild compression。\\n\\nScaling law 在 k=0.5 和 k=0.7 均展示完美的 monotonic pattern（|ρ|=1.0）： CV 越低（tokens 越 uniform），L2norm 越 harmful（因为 uniform distribution 上的  norm-based selection 退化为 spatial clustering），random 越有优势。\\n机制链： CV=0.055（π0.5）→ near-uniform importance → L2norm clusters spatially →  catastrophic coverage loss → +36pp random advantage\\nCV=0.151（X-VLA）→ moderate uniformity → L2norm partial clustering →  +27pp random advantage（smaller because BART creates some meaningful differentiation）\\nCV=0.215（OpenVLA）→ meaningful differentiation → L2norm preserves important tokens →  -1.8pp（L2norm slightly better, importance-based selection effective）\\nk=0.7 gap 小于 k=0.5 gap（22.2 vs 36.0 for π0.5）因为 k=0.7 保留更多 tokens， spatial coverage loss 更轻。但 monotonic ordering 保持不变。\\nRemaining seeds（已通过 multi-seed 确认）不会引入 exceptions： - π0.5 L2norm k=0.5 dual-seed: 33.4/33.6（std=0.1pp） - X-VLA random k=0.5 tri-seed: 70.6/71.0/69.2（σ=0.9pp） - Gap reproducibility confirmed across all available seeds。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":978,"startLine":1,"totalLines":978}}}
